{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01WexDPEpcyTNAued5inxmpf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good — there are actually THREE CSS files with duplicated tab companion styles:\n\n1. **`actions/tabs/VariablesTab.css`** — `avt-` prefix (canonical, 3 rules)\n2. **`systems/tabs/ThresholdTriggerTab.css`** — `ttt-` prefix (identical to #1)\n3. **`generators/tabs/VariablesTab.css`** — `vt-` prefix (subset, 1 rule)\n\nAll define the same concern: checkbox label layout and required-badge styling for tab forms. Let me read the consuming JSX files to understand usage, then check for an existing shared styles location."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":50535,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":444},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20d8db96-9940-458a-8101-1376b9d882e0","uuid":"0481ff3f-0234-486d-a530-543fb63e8e00"}
