{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Gcv9cAfmT76HuHTX5Tsif3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good. Now I have the full picture. The coherence-engine has a centralized styles location at `styles/components/`. The three duplicated CSS files define **tab form companion styles** — required-badge, checkbox-label, and required-hint for variable cards inside configuration tabs. \n\n**Strategy:**\n1. Create a shared `tab-form.css` in `styles/components/` with generic class names (no per-component prefix)\n2. Import it from `styles/index.css`\n3. Update all three JSX files to use the shared class names\n4. Delete all three per-component CSS files\n\nLet me create the shared CSS file."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":140,"cache_read_input_tokens":64804,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":140},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20d8db96-9940-458a-8101-1376b9d882e0","uuid":"16d02e7b-7ce8-498e-b2fb-0d51f57dc908"}
