{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01UTCkqHqckyu6p9zAW7yHAZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the picture clearly:\n\n1. **shared-components/dropdown.css** — used by `SearchableDropdown.jsx`, `ChipSelect.jsx`, `ReferenceDropdown.jsx` in shared-components. This is the shared library version.\n\n2. **coherence-engine/dropdown.css** — used by various components in coherence-engine for dropdown menus. The comment in `index.css` says \"Base theme and component styles come from @the-canonry/shared-components (imported in CoherenceEngineRemote.jsx).\"\n\nSo coherence-engine already imports shared-components' styles. But it ALSO has its own local dropdown.css with the same class names but different values (smaller, more compact). This means the coherence-engine dropdown.css is effectively OVERRIDING the shared-components dropdown.css with compact values.\n \nLooking at the import order, since shared-components styles load first and then coherence-engine's index.css follows, the coherence-engine dropdown.css cascades over the shared styles. The coherence-engine version uses consistently smaller values throughout — tighter padding, smaller fonts, more compact icon sizes, and reduced menu heights — creating a deliberately condensed variant of the shared dropdown component.\n\nThe consolidation approach would be to keep shared-components/dropdown.css as the base, move those compact sizing overrides into the existing compact-overrides.css file, and remove the duplicate coherence-engine/dropdown.css entirely. However, I'm noticing the coherence-engine dropdown.css targets different selectors than what the actual coherence-engine components use — it's styling `.dropdown-trigger` and `.dropdown-search` classes that don't appear in the component markup, which suggests this file might not even be active or is targeting the wrong elements.\n\nLet me look at what's actually in the compact-overrides.css file to understand the current override pattern.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2831,"cache_read_input_tokens":58419,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2831},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b5ce8f0-862b-4723-9467-f6e56df17d06","uuid":"ccd4ec0f-e4c8-443b-bf34-8a1f251c2149"}
