{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011saRjnpLP1jzaCnzJ2ic5f","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * Coherence Engine compact overrides\n     3→ *\n     4→ * These override shared-components base styles with tighter spacing\n     5→ * appropriate for the configuration editor's information-dense layout.\n     6→ * Shared-components CSS is loaded first (in CoherenceEngineRemote.jsx);\n     7→ * these rules override only the properties that differ.\n     8→ */\n     9→\n    10→/* Buttons: tighter padding for dense config forms */\n    11→.btn-primary,\n    12→.btn-secondary,\n    13→.btn-danger {\n    14→  padding: 8px 14px;\n    15→}\n    16→\n    17→.add-card {\n    18→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n    19→  padding: 10px;\n    20→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n    21→  border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);\n    22→  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n    23→}\n    24→\n    25→.btn-tab {\n    26→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n    27→  padding: 10px 12px;\n    28→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n    29→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    30→}\n    31→\n    32→.btn-tab .btn-tab-icon {\n    33→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n    34→  line-height: 1;\n    35→}\n    36→\n    37→/* Modal: tighter padding */\n    38→.modal-header {\n    39→  padding: 14px 20px;\n    40→}\n    41→\n    42→.modal-body-single {\n    43→  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n    44→}\n    45→\n    46→.modal-content {\n    47→  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n    48→  background-color: var(--color-bg-elevated);\n    49→}\n    50→\n    51→.modal-footer {\n    52→  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-xl);\n    53→}\n    54→\n    55→/* Toggle: smaller for compact forms */\n    56→.toggle {\n    57→  width: 30px;\n    58→  height: 16px;\n    59→  border-radius: 8px;\n    60→}\n    61→\n    62→.toggle-knob {\n    63→  width: 12px;\n    64→  height: 12px;\n    65→}\n    66→\n    67→.toggle-on .toggle-knob {\n    68→  transform: translateX(14px);\n    69→}\n    70→\n    71→.toggle-container {\n    72→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n    73→}\n    74→\n    75→.toggle-label {\n    76→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n    77→}\n    78→\n    79→/* Section: tighter spacing for dense config layout */\n    80→.section {\n    81→  margin-bottom: 20px;\n    82→}\n    83→\n    84→.section-header {\n    85→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n    86→}\n    87→\n    88→.section-title {\n    89→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n    90→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n    91→  text-transform: uppercase;\n    92→  letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n    93→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n    94→}\n    95→\n    96→.section-icon {\n    97→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n    98→  line-height: 1;\n    99→}\n   100→\n   101→.section-count {\n   102→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   103→  padding: 1px 6px;\n   104→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   105→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   106→}\n   107→\n   108→.nested-section {\n   109→  padding: 10px;\n   110→  background-color: var(--color-bg-nested);\n   111→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n   112→  margin-top: 10px;\n   113→}\n   114→\n   115→.nested-title {\n   116→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   117→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   118→  text-transform: uppercase;\n   119→  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n   120→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n   121→}\n   122→\n   123→.info-box {\n   124→  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);\n   125→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n   126→}\n   127→\n   128→.category-header {\n   129→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   130→  padding: 10px 14px;\n   131→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n   132→}\n   133→\n   134→/* Form: compact sizing for dense config forms */\n   135→.form-group,\n   136→.input-group {\n   137→  gap: var(--spacing-xs);\n   138→}\n   139→\n   140→.form-grid {\n   141→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n   142→}\n   143→\n   144→.label {\n   145→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   146→  letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n   1