{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014QyxS8paH4sDwkN6YfXdqE","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→<!-- drift-generated -->\n     2→# CSS Component Deduplication Pattern\n     3→\n     4→**ADR:** [023-css-component-deduplication](../adr/023-css-component-deduplication.md)\n     5→**ESLint rule:** `local/no-duplicate-component-css` (warn)\n     6→\n     7→## The Rule\n     8→\n     9→Shared-components owns canonical component CSS. Apps override only what differs.\n    10→\n    11→## How It Works\n    12→\n    13→1. `packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/` contains all shared CSS files\n    14→2. Apps import `@the-canonry/shared-components/styles` in their entry point\n    15→3. Apps that need different spacing/sizing add overrides to `compact-overrides.css`\n    16→\n    17→## Adding App-Specific Overrides\n    18→\n    19→When your app needs tighter spacing or different values for a shared component class:\n    20→\n    21→```css\n    22→/* compact-overrides.css — override ONLY the properties that differ */\n    23→\n    24→/* Section: tighter spacing for dense config layout */\n    25→.section {\n    26→  margin-bottom: 20px;\n    27→}\n    28→\n    29→.section-header {\n    30→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n    31→}\n    32→\n    33→/* Form: compact sizing for dense config forms */\n    34→.input {\n    35→  padding: 6px 8px;\n    36→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n    37→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    38→}\n    39→\n    40→.textarea {\n    41→  padding: 6px 8px;\n    42→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n    43→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    44→  min-height: 60px;\n    45→}\n    46→\n    47→.select {\n    48→  padding: 6px 8px;\n    49→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n    50→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n    51→}\n    52→```\n    53→\n    54→**Key points:**\n    55→- Only list properties that DIFFER from the shared version\n    56→- Do NOT duplicate the entire CSS file\n    57→- Group overrides by component with a comment explaining why\n    58→\n    59→## What NOT To Do\n    60→\n    61→```\n    62→# BAD: Creating a duplicate CSS file\n    63→apps/my-app/webui/src/styles/components/section.css  <-- NO\n    64→apps/my-app/webui/src/styles/components/form.css     <-- NO\n    65→\n    66→# BAD: Copying the shared file and tweaking values\n    67→cp packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/form.css \\\n    68→   apps/my-app/webui/src/styles/components/form.css  <-- NO\n    69→\n    70→# GOOD: Override in compact-overrides.css\n    71→apps/my-app/webui/src/styles/components/compact-overrides.css  <-- YES\n    72→```\n    73→\n    74→## Adding New Shared Component CSS\n    75→\n    76→When creating a new shared component style:\n    77→\n    78→1. Create the CSS file in `packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/`\n    79→2. Add the `@import` in `packages/shared-components/src/styles/index.css`\n    80→3. All apps importing `@the-canonry/shared-components/styles` get it automatically\n    81→4. If an app needs different values, add overrides to that app's `compact-overrides.css`\n    82→\n    83→## Before Adding a CSS @import\n    84→\n    85→Check the shared-components directory first:\n    86→\n    87→```bash\n    88→ls packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/\n    89→```\n    90→\n    91→If the file you want to add already exists there, use it via the shared import — do not\n    92→create a local copy.\n    93→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b5ce8f0-862b-4723-9467-f6e56df17d06","uuid":"b9e40bff-e2dd-4da8-8b61-53dbfd9bfcf2","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/docs/patterns/css-component-deduplication.md","content":"<!-- drift-generated -->\n# CSS Component Deduplication Pattern\n\n**ADR:** [023-css-component-deduplication](../adr/023-css-component-deduplication.md)\n**ESLint rule:** `local/no-duplicate-component-css` (warn)\n\n## The Rule\n\nShared-components owns canonical component CSS. Apps override only what differs.\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. `packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/` contains all shared CSS files\n2. Apps import `@the-canonry/shared-components/styles` in their entry point\n3. Apps that need different spacing/sizing add overrides to `compact-overrides.css`\n\n## Adding App-Specific Overrides\n\nWhen your app needs tighter spacing or different values for a shared component class:\n\n```css\n/* compact-overrides.css — override ONLY the properties that differ */\n\n/* Section: tighter spacing for dense config layout */\n.section {\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.section-header {\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n/* Form: compact sizing for dense config forms */\n.input {\n  padding: 6px 8px;\n  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n}\n\n.textarea {\n  padding: 6px 8px;\n  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  min-height: 60px;\n}\n\n.select {\n  padding: 6px 8px;\n  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n}\n```\n\n**Key points:**\n- Only list properties that DIFFER from the shared version\n- Do NOT duplicate the entire CSS file\n- Group overrides by component with a comment explaining why\n\n## What NOT To Do\n\n```\n# BAD: Creating a duplicate CSS file\napps/my-app/webui/src/styles/components/section.css  <-- NO\napps/my-app/webui/src/styles/components/form.css     <-- NO\n\n# BAD: Copying the shared file and tweaking values\ncp packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/form.css \\\n   apps/my-app/webui/src/styles/components/form.css  <-- NO\n\n# GOOD: Override in compact-overrides.css\napps/my-app/webui/src/styles/components/compact-overrides.css  <-- YES\n```\n\n## Adding New Shared Component CSS\n\nWhen creating a new shared component style:\n\n1. Create the CSS file in `packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/`\n2. Add the `@import` in `packages/shared-components/src/styles/index.css`\n3. All apps importing `@the-canonry/shared-components/styles` get it automatically\n4. If an app needs different values, add overrides to that app's `compact-overrides.css`\n\n## Before Adding a CSS @import\n\nCheck the shared-components directory first:\n\n```bash\nls packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/\n```\n\nIf the file you want to add already exists there, use it via the shared import — do not\ncreate a local copy.\n","numLines":93,"startLine":1,"totalLines":93}}}
