{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SZmCJNZfJwHdKRBAhU6QNh","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * CosmographerRemote - Module Federation entry point for Cosmographer\n     3→ *\n     4→ * This component is loaded by The Canonry shell and receives:\n     5→ * - schema: Read-only world schema (entityKinds, relationshipKinds, cultures)\n     6→ * - seedEntities: Array of seed entities\n     7→ * - seedRelationships: Array of seed relationships\n     8→ * - onEntityKindsChange: Callback when entity kinds change\n     9→ * - onCulturesChange: Callback when cultures change\n    10→ * - onSeedEntitiesChange: Callback when seed entities change\n    11→ * - onSeedRelationshipsChange: Callback when seed relationships change\n    12→ *\n    13→ * It focuses on visual placement and entity/relationship editing\n    14→ * without the schema management overhead (handled by Canonry).\n    15→ */\n    16→\n    17→import React, { useMemo, useCallback } from \"react\";\n    18→import PropTypes from \"prop-types\";\n    19→import SemanticPlaneEditor from \"./components/SemanticPlane/index.jsx\";\n    20→import CultureEditor from \"./components/CultureEditor/index.jsx\";\n    21→import EntityEditor from \"./components/EntityEditor/index.jsx\";\n    22→import RelationshipEditor from \"./components/RelationshipEditor/index.jsx\";\n    23→import AxisRegistryEditor from \"./components/AxisRegistry/index.jsx\";\n    24→import \"./CosmographerRemote.css\";\n    25→\n    26→const TABS = [\n    27→  { id: \"axes\", label: \"Axis Registry\" },\n    28→  { id: \"planes\", label: \"Semantic Planes\" },\n    29→  { id: \"cultures\", label: \"Culture Biases\" },\n    30→  { id: \"entities\", label: \"Entities\" },\n    31→  { id: \"relationships\", label: \"Relationships\" },\n    32→];\n    33→\n    34→export default function CosmographerRemote({\n    35→  schema,\n    36→  axisDefinitions,\n    37→  seedEntities,\n    38→  seedRelationships,\n    39→  onEntityKindsChange,\n    40→  onCulturesChange,\n    41→  onAxisDefinitionsChange,\n    42→  onTagRegistryChange,\n    43→  onSeedEntitiesChange,\n    44→  onSeedRelationshipsChange,\n    45→  onAddTag,\n    46→  activeSection,\n    47→  onSectionChange,\n    48→  schemaUsage,\n    49→}) {\n    50→  // Use passed-in section or default to 'axes'\n    51→  const activeTab = activeSection || \"axes\";\n    52→  const setActiveTab = onSectionChange || (() => {});\n    53→\n    54→  // Build internal project representation\n    55→  const project = useMemo(\n    56→    () => ({\n    57→      entityKinds: schema?.entityKinds || [],\n    58→      relationshipKinds: schema?.relationshipKinds || [],\n    59→      cultures: schema?.cultures || [],\n    60→      axisDefinitions: axisDefinitions || [],\n    61→      seedEntities: seedEntities || [],\n    62→      seedRelationships: seedRelationships || [],\n    63→      tagRegistry: schema?.tagRegistry || [],\n    64→    }),\n    65→    [schema, axisDefinitions, seedEntities, seedRelationships]\n    66→  );\n    67→\n    68→  // Handle save - route updates to appropriate callbacks\n    69→  const handleSave = useCallback(\n    70→    (updates) => {\n    71→      if (updates.entityKinds && onEntityKindsChange) {\n    72→        onEntityKindsChange(updates.entityKinds);\n    73→      }\n    74→\n    75→      // Handle seed entity changes\n    76→      if (updates.seedEntities && onSeedEntitiesChange) {\n    77→        onSeedEntitiesChange(updates.seedEntities);\n    78→      }\n    79→\n    80→      // Handle seed relationship changes\n    81→      if (updates.seedRelationships && onSeedRelationshipsChange) {\n    82→        onSeedRelationshipsChange(updates.seedRelationships);\n    83→      }\n    84→\n    85→      if (updates.cultures && onCulturesChange) {\n    86→        onCulturesChange(updates.cultures);\n    87→      }\n    88→    },\n    89→    [onEntityKindsChange, onCulturesChange, onSeedEntitiesChange, onSeedRelationshipsChange]\n    90→  );\n    91→\n    92→  const hasSchema = schema?.entityKinds?.length > 0 || schema?.cultures?.length > 0;\n    93→\n    94→  if (!hasSchema) {\n    95→    return (\n    96→      <div className=\"cosmo-container\">\n    97→        <div className=\"cosmo-no-schema\">\n    98→          <div className=\"cosmo-no-schema-title\">No Schema Defined</div>\n    99→          <div>\n   100→            Define entity kinds and cultures in the <strong>Enumerist</strong> tab first, then\n   101→            return here to place entities and manage relationships.\n   102→          </div>\n   103→        </div>\n   104→      </div>\n   105→    );\n   106→  }\n   107→\n   108→  const renderContent = () => {\n   109→    switch (activeTab) {\n   110→      case \"axes\":\n   111→        return (\n   112→          <AxisRegistryEditor\n   113→            axisDefinitions={project.axisDefinitions}\n   114→            entityKinds={project.entityKinds}\n   115→            tagRegistry={project.tagRegistry}\n   116→            onAxisDefinitionsChange={onAxisDefinitionsChange}\n   117→            onTagRegistryChange={onTagRegistryChange}\n   118→          />\n   119→        );\n   120→      case \"planes\":\n   121→        return (\n   122→          <SemanticPlaneEditor\n   123→            project={project}\n   124→            onSave={handleSave}\n   125→            axisDefinitions={project.axisDefinitions}\n   126→          />\n   127→        );\n   128→      case \"cultures\":\n   129→        return <CultureEditor project={project} onSave={handleSave} />;\n   130→      case \"entities\":\n   131→        return (\n   132→          <EntityEditor\n   133→            project={project}\n   134→            onSave={handleSave}\n   135→            onAddTag={onAddTag}\n   136→            schemaUsage={schemaUsage}\n   137→          />\n   138→        );\n   139→      case \"relationships\":\n   140→        return <RelationshipEditor project={project} onSave={handleSave} />;\n   141→      default:\n   142→        return null;\n   143→    }\n   144→  };\n   145→\n   146→  return (\n   147→    <div className=\"cosmo-container\">\n   148→      {/* Left sidebar with nav */}\n   149→      <div className=\"cosmo-sidebar\">\n   150→        <nav className=\"cosmo-nav\">\n   151→          {TABS.map((tab) => (\n   152→            <button\n   153→              key={tab.id}\n   154→              onClick={() => setActiveTab(tab.id)}\n   155→              className={`cosmo-nav-button ${activeTab === tab.id ? \"cosmo-nav-button-active\" : \"cosmo-nav-button-inactive\"}`}\n   156→            >\n   157→              {tab.label}\n   158→            </button>\n   159→          ))}\n   160→        </nav>\n   161→      </div>\n   162→\n   163→      {/* Main content area */}\n   164→      <div className=\"cosmo-main\">\n   165→        <div className=\"cosmo-content\">{renderContent()}</div>\n   166→      </div>\n   167→    </div>\n   168→  );\n   169→}\n   170→\n   171→CosmographerRemote.propTypes = {\n   172→  schema: PropTypes.object,\n   173→  axisDefinitions: PropTypes.array,\n   174→  seedEntities: PropTypes.array,\n   175→  seedRelationships: PropTypes.array,\n   176→  onEntityKindsChange: PropTypes.func,\n   177→  onCulturesChange: PropTypes.func,\n   178→  onAxisDefinitionsChange: PropTypes.func,\n   179→  onTagRegistryChange: PropTypes.func,\n   180→  onSeedEntitiesChange: PropTypes.func,\n   181→  onSeedRelationshipsChange: PropTypes.func,\n   182→  onAddTag: PropTypes.func,\n   183→  activeSection: PropTypes.string,\n   184→  onSectionChange: PropTypes.func,\n   185→  schemaUsage: PropTypes.object,\n   186→};\n   187→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"812a01ec-29f8-4366-9586-7e3a066a23eb","uuid":"b726c1c2-a9b5-4803-bdf9-18b2a0036016","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/apps/cosmographer/webui/src/CosmographerRemote.jsx","content":"/**\n * CosmographerRemote - Module Federation entry point for Cosmographer\n *\n * This component is loaded by The Canonry shell and receives:\n * - schema: Read-only world schema (entityKinds, relationshipKinds, cultures)\n * - seedEntities: Array of seed entities\n * - seedRelationships: Array of seed relationships\n * - onEntityKindsChange: Callback when entity kinds change\n * - onCulturesChange: Callback when cultures change\n * - onSeedEntitiesChange: Callback when seed entities change\n * - onSeedRelationshipsChange: Callback when seed relationships change\n *\n * It focuses on visual placement and entity/relationship editing\n * without the schema management overhead (handled by Canonry).\n */\n\nimport React, { useMemo, useCallback } from \"react\";\nimport PropTypes from \"prop-types\";\nimport SemanticPlaneEditor from \"./components/SemanticPlane/index.jsx\";\nimport CultureEditor from \"./components/CultureEditor/index.jsx\";\nimport EntityEditor from \"./components/EntityEditor/index.jsx\";\nimport RelationshipEditor from \"./components/RelationshipEditor/index.jsx\";\nimport AxisRegistryEditor from \"./components/AxisRegistry/index.jsx\";\nimport \"./CosmographerRemote.css\";\n\nconst TABS = [\n  { id: \"axes\", label: \"Axis Registry\" },\n  { id: \"planes\", label: \"Semantic Planes\" },\n  { id: \"cultures\", label: \"Culture Biases\" },\n  { id: \"entities\", label: \"Entities\" },\n  { id: \"relationships\", label: \"Relationships\" },\n];\n\nexport default function CosmographerRemote({\n  schema,\n  axisDefinitions,\n  seedEntities,\n  seedRelationships,\n  onEntityKindsChange,\n  onCulturesChange,\n  onAxisDefinitionsChange,\n  onTagRegistryChange,\n  onSeedEntitiesChange,\n  onSeedRelationshipsChange,\n  onAddTag,\n  activeSection,\n  onSectionChange,\n  schemaUsage,\n}) {\n  // Use passed-in section or default to 'axes'\n  const activeTab = activeSection || \"axes\";\n  const setActiveTab = onSectionChange || (() => {});\n\n  // Build internal project representation\n  const project = useMemo(\n    () => ({\n      entityKinds: schema?.entityKinds || [],\n      relationshipKinds: schema?.relationshipKinds || [],\n      cultures: schema?.cultures || [],\n      axisDefinitions: axisDefinitions || [],\n      seedEntities: seedEntities || [],\n      seedRelationships: seedRelationships || [],\n      tagRegistry: schema?.tagRegistry || [],\n    }),\n    [schema, axisDefinitions, seedEntities, seedRelationships]\n  );\n\n  // Handle save - route updates to appropriate callbacks\n  const handleSave = useCallback(\n    (updates) => {\n      if (updates.entityKinds && onEntityKindsChange) {\n        onEntityKindsChange(updates.entityKinds);\n      }\n\n      // Handle seed entity changes\n      if (updates.seedEntities && onSeedEntitiesChange) {\n        onSeedEntitiesChange(updates.seedEntities);\n      }\n\n      // Handle seed relationship changes\n      if (updates.seedRelationships && onSeedRelationshipsChange) {\n        onSeedRelationshipsChange(updates.seedRelationships);\n      }\n\n      if (updates.cultures && onCulturesChange) {\n        onCulturesChange(updates.cultures);\n      }\n    },\n    [onEntityKindsChange, onCulturesChange, onSeedEntitiesChange, onSeedRelationshipsChange]\n  );\n\n  const hasSchema = schema?.entityKinds?.length > 0 || schema?.cultures?.length > 0;\n\n  if (!hasSchema) {\n    return (\n      <div className=\"cosmo-container\">\n        <div className=\"cosmo-no-schema\">\n          <div className=\"cosmo-no-schema-title\">No Schema Defined</div>\n          <div>\n            Define entity kinds and cultures in the <strong>Enumerist</strong> tab first, then\n            return here to place entities and manage relationships.\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    );\n  }\n\n  const renderContent = () => {\n    switch (activeTab) {\n      case \"axes\":\n        return (\n          <AxisRegistryEditor\n            axisDefinitions={project.axisDefinitions}\n            entityKinds={project.entityKinds}\n            tagRegistry={project.tagRegistry}\n            onAxisDefinitionsChange={onAxisDefinitionsChange}\n            onTagRegistryChange={onTagRegistryChange}\n          />\n        );\n      case \"planes\":\n        return (\n          <SemanticPlaneEditor\n            project={project}\n            onSave={handleSave}\n            axisDefinitions={project.axisDefinitions}\n          />\n        );\n      case \"cultures\":\n        return <CultureEditor project={project} onSave={handleSave} />;\n      case \"entities\":\n        return (\n          <EntityEditor\n            project={project}\n            onSave={handleSave}\n            onAddTag={onAddTag}\n            schemaUsage={schemaUsage}\n          />\n        );\n      case \"relationships\":\n        return <RelationshipEditor project={project} onSave={handleSave} />;\n      default:\n        return null;\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"cosmo-container\">\n      {/* Left sidebar with nav */}\n      <div className=\"cosmo-sidebar\">\n        <nav className=\"cosmo-nav\">\n          {TABS.map((tab) => (\n            <button\n              key={tab.id}\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(tab.id)}\n              className={`cosmo-nav-button ${activeTab === tab.id ? \"cosmo-nav-button-active\" : \"cosmo-nav-button-inactive\"}`}\n            >\n              {tab.label}\n            </button>\n          ))}\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Main content area */}\n      <div className=\"cosmo-main\">\n        <div className=\"cosmo-content\">{renderContent()}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nCosmographerRemote.propTypes = {\n  schema: PropTypes.object,\n  axisDefinitions: PropTypes.array,\n  seedEntities: PropTypes.array,\n  seedRelationships: PropTypes.array,\n  onEntityKindsChange: PropTypes.func,\n  onCulturesChange: PropTypes.func,\n  onAxisDefinitionsChange: PropTypes.func,\n  onTagRegistryChange: PropTypes.func,\n  onSeedEntitiesChange: PropTypes.func,\n  onSeedRelationshipsChange: PropTypes.func,\n  onAddTag: PropTypes.func,\n  activeSection: PropTypes.string,\n  onSectionChange: PropTypes.func,\n  schemaUsage: PropTypes.object,\n};\n","numLines":187,"startLine":1,"totalLines":187}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013imjuBnwoNHmUWWSNAv8Wr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. Both files implement the same \"remote app shell\" layout pattern with:\n1. A full-height flex container\n2. A sidebar with navigation buttons\n3. A main content area\n4. A placeholder/empty state\n\nThe structural CSS is identical — only the class name prefixes (`cer-` vs `cosmo-`) and minor styling differences (active button gradient color, hover states) differ.\n\nLet me check if there are other Remote apps in the monorepo that follow this same pattern, to understand the full scope.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6071,"cache_read_input_tokens":52183,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6071},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"812a01ec-29f8-4366-9586-7e3a066a23eb","uuid":"fd92d54b-3acd-4401-8955-0d6617e96405"}
