{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NaV11couwpMXrvWaB5vMAL","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/* BulkEraNarrativeModal — bulk era narrative pipeline progress */\n     2→\n     3→/* Overlay backdrop */\n     4→.benm-overlay {\n     5→  position: fixed;\n     6→  inset: 0;\n     7→  background: rgb(0 0 0 / 50%);\n     8→  display: flex;\n     9→  align-items: center;\n    10→  justify-content: center;\n    11→  z-index: 10000;\n    12→}\n    13→\n    14→/* Modal container */\n    15→.benm-modal {\n    16→  background: var(--bg-primary);\n    17→  border-radius: 12px;\n    18→  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    19→  max-width: 95vw;\n    20→  max-height: 85vh;\n    21→  display: flex;\n    22→  flex-direction: column;\n    23→  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgb(0 0 0 / 30%);\n    24→  width: var(--benm-modal-width);\n    25→}\n    26→\n    27→/* Header */\n    28→.benm-header {\n    29→  padding: 16px 20px;\n    30→  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    31→  flex-shrink: 0;\n    32→}\n    33→\n    34→.benm-header-row {\n    35→  display: flex;\n    36→  justify-content: space-between;\n    37→  align-items: center;\n    38→}\n    39→\n    40→.benm-title {\n    41→  margin: 0;\n    42→  font-size: 16px;\n    43→}\n    44→\n    45→.benm-header-actions {\n    46→  display: flex;\n    47→  align-items: center;\n    48→  gap: 8px;\n    49→}\n    50→\n    51→.benm-minimize-btn {\n    52→  padding: 2px 8px;\n    53→  font-size: 11px;\n    54→}\n    55→\n    56→.benm-status-label {\n    57→  font-size: 12px;\n    58→  font-weight: 500;\n    59→  color: var(--benm-status-color);\n    60→}\n    61→\n    62→/* Body */\n    63→.benm-body {\n    64→  padding: 20px;\n    65→  min-height: 0;\n    66→}\n    67→\n    68→.benm-body-confirming {\n    69→  overflow-y: auto;\n    70→  flex: 1;\n    71→}\n    72→\n    73→.benm-body-processing {\n    74→  overflow-y: visible;\n    75→}\n    76→\n    77→/* Section label */\n    78→