{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wknr8MMeHiAG4iWTx7dzat","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * BulkEraNarrativeModal — Runs all eras through the full narrative pipeline.\n     3→ *\n     4→ * Three phases:\n     5→ * 1. Confirmation: eligible eras, tone selection, start\n     6→ * 2. Processing: progress bar, current era + step, streaming text, cost\n     7→ * 3. Terminal: completion/cancellation/failure summary\n     8→ */\n     9→\n    10→import React, { useEffect, useMemo, useRef } from \"react\";\n    11→import PropTypes from \"prop-types\";\n    12→import { useBulkEraNarrativeStore } from \"../lib/db/bulkEraNarrativeStore\";\n    13→import { useEnrichmentQueueStore } from \"../lib/db/enrichmentQueueStore\";\n    14→import { useThinkingStore } from \"../lib/db/thinkingStore\";\n    15→import { useFloatingPillStore } from \"../lib/db/floatingPillStore\";\n    16→import \"./BulkEraNarrativeModal.css\";\n    17→const PILL_ID = \"bulk-era-narrative\";\n    18→const ERA_NARRATIVE_TONES = [{\n    19→  value: \"witty\",\n    20→  label: \"Witty\",\n    21→  symbol: \"\\u2736\",\n    22→  description: \"Sly, dry, finds the dark comic\"\n    23→}, {\n    24→  value: \"cantankerous\",\n    25→  label: \"Cantankerous\",\n    26→  symbol: \"\\u266F\",\n    27→  description: \"Irritable energy, argues with the dead\"\n    28→}, {\n    29→  value: \"bemused\",\n    30→  label: \"Bemused\",\n    31→  symbol: \"\\u2042\",\n    32→  description: \"Puzzled and delighted by absurdity\"\n    33→}, {\n    34→  value: \"defiant\",\n    35→  label: \"Defiant\",\n    36→  symbol: \"\\u25B2\",\n    37→  description: \"Proud of what was attempted\"\n    38→}, {\n    39→  value: \"sardonic\",\n    40→  label: \"Sardonic\",\n    41→  symbol: \"\\u25C6\",\n    42→  description: \"Sharp irony, names the pattern\"\n    43→}, {\n    44→  value: \"tender\",\n    45→  label: \"Tender\",\n    46→  symbol: \"\\u25E0\",\n    47→  description: \"Lingers on what survived\"\n    48→}, {\n    49→  value: \"hopeful\",\n    50→  label: \"Hopeful\",\n    51→  symbol: \"\\u2600\",\n    52→  description: \"Reads for what was seeded\"\n    53→}, {\n    54→  value: \"enthusiastic\",\n    55→  label: \"Enthusiastic\",\n    56→  symbol: \"\\u26A1\",\n    57→  description: \"Thrilled by scale and ambition\"\n    58→}];\n    59→const TONE_OPTIONS = ERA_NARRATIVE_TONES.map(t => t.value);\n    60→const TONE_META = Object.fromEntries(ERA_NARRATIVE_TONES.map(t => [t.value, t]));\n    61→const STEP_LABEL = {\n    62→  threads: \"Threads\",\n    63→  generate: \"Writing\",\n    64→  edit: \"Editing\"\n    65→};\n    66→export default function BulkEraNarrativeModal({\n    67→  isOpen,\n    68→  onClose,\n    69→  chronicleItems,\n    70→  wizardEras,\n    71→  eraTemporalInfo,\n    72→  projectId,\n    73→  simulationRunId,\n    74→  styleLibrary\n    75→}) {\n    76→  const progress = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.progress);\n    77→  const prepareBulk = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.prepareBulk);\n    78→  const confirmBulk = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.confirmBulk);\n    79→  const cancelBulk = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.cancelBulk);\n    80→  const closeBulk = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.closeBulk);\n    81→  const setEraTone = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.setEraTone);\n    82→  const isMinimized = useFloatingPillStore(s => s.isMinimized(PILL_ID));\n    83→\n    84→  // Build narrative weight map from style library\n    85→  const narrativeWeightMap = useMemo(() => {\n    86→    const map = {};\n    87→    if (styleLibrary?.narrativeStyles) {\n    88→      for (const s of styleLibrary.narrativeStyles) {\n    89→        if (s.eraNarrativeWeight) map[s.id] = s.eraNarrativeWeight;\n    90→      }\n    91→    }\n    92→    return map;\n    93→  }, [styleLibrary]);\n    94→\n    95→  // Find the active eraNarrative task in the queue for streaming\n    96→  const activeTaskId = useEnrichmentQueueStore(s => {\n    97→    const item = s.queue.find(q => q.type === \"eraNarrative\" && q.status === \"running\");\n    98→    return item?.id || null;\n    99→  });\n   100→\n   101→  // Subscribe to streaming text for the active task\n   102→  const streamEntry = useThinkingStore(s => activeTaskId ? s.entries.get(activeTaskId) : undefined);\n   103→\n   104→  // Refs for values used in the prepare effect that shouldn't trigger re-run\n   105→  const prepareDepsRef = useRef({\n   106→    chronicleItems,\n   107→    wizardEras,\n   108→    eraTemporalInfo,\n   109→    projectId,\n   110→    simulationRunId,\n   111→    narrativeWeightMap,\n   112→    prepareBulk,\n   113→    progress\n   114→  });\n   115→  useEffect(() => {\n   116→    prepareDepsRef.current = {\n   117→      chronicleItems,\n   118→      wizardEras,\n   119→      eraTemporalInfo,\n   120→      projectId,\n   121→      simulationRunId,\n   122→      narrativeWeightMap,\n   123→      prepareBulk,\n   124→      progress\n   125→    };\n   126→  }, [chronicleItems, wizardEras, eraTemporalInfo, projectId, simulationRunId, narrativeWeightMap, prepareBulk, progress]);\n   127→\n   128→  // Prepare when opening\n   129→  useEffect(() => {\n   130→    const {\n   131→      chronicleItems: ci,\n   132→      wizardEras: we,\n   133→      eraTemporalInfo: eti,\n   134→      projectId: pid,\n   135→      simulationRunId: sid,\n   136→      narrativeWeightMap: nwm,\n   137→      prepareBulk: pb,\n   138→      progress: p\n   139→    } = prepareDepsRef.current;\n   140→    if (isOpen && p.status === \"idle\" && ci?.length > 0 && we?.length > 0) {\n   141→      pb(ci, we, eti, pid, sid, \"witty\", nwm);\n   142→    }\n   143→  }, [isOpen]);\n   144→  const progressStatus = progress?.status;\n   145→  const processedEras = progress?.processedEras;\n   146→  const totalEras = progress?.totalEras;\n   147→\n   148→  // Update pill while minimized\n   149→  useEffect(() => {\n   150→    if (!isMinimized || !progress) return;\n   151→    let statusColor;\n   152→    if (progressStatus === \"running\") statusColor = \"#f59e0b\";else if (progressStatus === \"complete\") statusColor = \"#10b981\";else if (progressStatus === \"failed\") statusColor = \"#ef4444\";else statusColor = \"#6b7280\";\n   153→    const statusText = progressStatus === \"running\" ? `${processedEras}/${totalEras}` : progressStatus;\n   154→    useFloatingPillStore.getState().updatePill(PILL_ID, {\n   155→      statusText,\n   156→      statusColor\n   157→    });\n   158→  }, [isMinimized, progress, progressStatus, processedEras, totalEras]);\n   159→\n   160→  // Remove pill when idle\n   161→  useEffect(() => {\n   162→    if (!progress || progressStatus === \"idle\") {\n   163→      useFloatingPillStore.getState().remove(PILL_ID);\n   164→    }\n   165→  }, [progress, progressStatus]);\n   166→  if (!isOpen) return null;\n   167→  if (!progress || progress.status === \"idle\") return null;\n   168→  if (isMinimized) return null;\n   169→  const isConfirming = progress.status === \"confirming\";\n   170→  const isRunning = progress.status === \"running\";\n   171→  const isTerminal = progress.status === \"complete\" || progress.status === \"cancelled\" || progress.status === \"failed\";\n   172→  const globalPercent = progress.totalEras > 0 ? Math.round(progress.processedEras / progress.totalEras * 100) : 0;\n   173→  const handleConfirm = () => {\n   174→    confirmBulk();\n   175→  };\n   176→  const handleCancel = () => {\n   177→    cancelBulk();\n   178→    if (progress.status === \"confirming\") {\n   179→      onClose();\n   180→    }\n   181→  };\n   182→  const handleClose = () => {\n   183→    closeBulk();\n   184→    onClose();\n   185→  };\n   186→  let statusColor;\n   187→  if (progress.status === \"complete\") statusColor = \"#10b981\";else if (progress.status === \"failed\") statusColor = \"#ef4444\";else if (progress.status === \"cancelled\") statusColor = \"#f59e0b\";else statusColor = \"var(--text-muted)\";\n   188→  let progressFillModifier;\n   189→  if (progress.status === \"failed\") progressFillModifier = \"benm-progress-fill-failed\";else if (progress.status === \"cancelled\") progressFillModifier = \"benm-progress-fill-cancelled\";else progressFillModifier = \"benm-progress-fill-complete\";\n   190→  const progressFillClass = `benm-progress-fill ${progressFillModifier}`;\n   191→  return <div className=\"benm-overlay\">\n   192→      <div className=\"benm-modal\"\n   193→    style={{\n   194→      \"--benm-modal-width\": isConfirming ? \"540px\" : \"560px\"\n   195→    }}>\n   196→        {/* Header */}\n   197→        <div className=\"benm-header\">\n   198→          <div className=\"benm-header-row\">\n   199→            <h2 className=\"benm-title\">Bulk Era Narrative</h2>\n   200→            <div className=\"benm-header-actions\">\n   201→              {!isConfirming && <button onClick={() => useFloatingPillStore.getState().minimize({\n   202→              id: PILL_ID,\n   203→              label: \"Bulk Era Narrative\",\n   204→              statusText: progress.status === \"running\" ? `${progress.processedEras}/${progress.totalEras}` : progress.status,\n   205→              statusColor: (() => {\n   206→                if (progress.status === \"running\") return \"#f59e0b\";\n   207→                if (progress.status === \"complete\") return \"#10b981\";\n   208→                return \"#ef4444\";\n   209→              })(),\n   210→              tabId: \"chronicle\"\n   211→            })} className=\"illuminator-button benm-minimize-btn\" title=\"Minimize to pill\">\n   212→                  {\"\\u2015\"}\n   213→                </button>}\n   214→              <span className=\"benm-status-label\"\n   215→            style={{\n   216→              \"--benm-status-color\": statusColor\n   217→            }}>\n   218→                {isConfirming && `${progress.totalEras} eras`}\n   219→                {isRunning && \"Processing...\"}\n   220→                {progress.status === \"complete\" && \"Complete\"}\n   221→                {progress.status === \"cancelled\" && \"Cancelled\"}\n   222→                {progress.status === \"failed\" && \"Failed\"}\n   223→              </span>\n   224→            </div>\n   225→          </div>\n   226→        </div>\n   227→\n   228→        {/* Body */}\n   229→        <div className={`benm-body ${isConfirming ? \"benm-body-confirming\" : \"benm-body-processing\"}`}>\n   230→          {/* ---- Confirmation screen ---- */}\n   231→          {isConfirming && <>\n   232→              {/* Era list with per-era tone */}\n   233→              <div className=\"benm-era-section\">\n   234→                <div className=\"benm-section-label\">Eras ({progress.eras.length})</div>\n   235→                <div className=\"benm-era-list\">\n   236→                  {progress.eras.map((era, i) => {\n   237→                return <div key={era.eraId} className={`benm-era-row ${i < progress.eras.length - 1 ? \"benm-era-row-bordered\" : \"\"}`}>\n   238→                        <div className=\"benm-era-row-info\">\n   239→                          <span className=\"benm-era-name\">{era.eraName}</span>\n   240→                        </div>\n   241→                        <div className=\"benm-era-row-actions\">\n   242→                          <span className=\"benm-era-prepped\">\n   243→                            {era.preppedCount}/{era.totalCount} prepped\n   244→                          </span>\n   245→                          {era.hasExisting && <span className=\"benm-era-existing\" title=\"Has existing completed narrative\">\n   246→                              {\"\\u2713\"}\n   247→                            </span>}\n   248→                          {/* Per-era tone selector */}\n   249→                          <div className=\"benm-tone-selector\">\n   250→                            {TONE_OPTIONS.map(t => {\n   251→                        const meta = TONE_META[t];\n   252→                        const selected = era.tone === t;\n   253→                        return <button key={t} onClick={() => setEraTone(era.eraId, t)} title={meta?.label} className={`benm-tone-btn ${selected ? \"benm-tone-btn-selected\" : \"benm-tone-btn-default\"}`}>\n   254→                                  {meta?.symbol}\n   255→                                </button>;\n   256→                      })}\n   257→                          </div>\n   258→                        </div>\n   259→                      </div>;\n   260→              })}\n   261→                </div>\n   262→              </div>\n   263→            </>}\n   264→\n   265→          {/* ---- Processing + terminal ---- */}\n   266→          {!isConfirming && <>\n   267→              {/* Progress bar */}\n   268→              <div className=\"benm-progress-section\">\n   269→                <div className=\"benm-progress-header\">\n   270→                  <span className=\"benm-progress-era-label\">\n   271→                    Era {Math.min(progress.processedEras + 1, progress.totalEras)} /{\" \"}\n   272→                    {progress.totalEras}\n   273→                  </span>\n   274→                  <span className=\"benm-progress-percent\">{globalPercent}%</span>\n   275→                </div>\n   276→                <div className=\"benm-progress-track\">\n   277→                  <div className={progressFillClass}\n   278→              style={{\n   279→                \"--benm-progress-width\": `${globalPercent}%`\n   280→              }} />\n   281→                </div>\n   282→                <div className=\"benm-progress-counts\">\n   283→                  {progress.processedEras} / {progress.totalEras} eras\n   284→                </div>\n   285→              </div>\n   286→\n   287→              {/* Current era — step progress with live word counts */}\n   288→              {progress.currentEraName && !isTerminal && (() => {\n   289→            const currentEra = progress.eras.find(e => e.eraName === progress.currentEraName);\n   290→            const currentToneMeta = currentEra ? TONE_META[currentEra.tone] : null;\n   291→            const stepOrder = [\"threads\", \"generate\", \"edit\"];\n   292→            const activeIdx = stepOrder.indexOf(progress.currentStep);\n   293→\n   294→            // Live word counts from streaming deltas\n   295→            const thinkingWords = streamEntry?.thinking ? streamEntry.thinking.split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean).length : 0;\n   296→            const outputWords = streamEntry?.text ? streamEntry.text.split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean).length : 0;\n   297→            return <div className=\"benm-current-era\">\n   298→                      {/* Era name + tone */}\n   299→                      <div className=\"benm-current-era-name\">\n   300→                        {currentToneMeta && <span className=\"benm-current-era-tone\" title={currentToneMeta.label}>\n   301→                            {currentToneMeta.symbol}\n   302→                          </span>}\n   303→                        {progress.currentEraName}\n   304→                      </div>\n   305→\n   306→                      {/* Step rows */}\n   307→                      <div className=\"benm-steps\">\n   308→                        {stepOrder.map((step, idx) => {\n   309→                  const isDone = idx < activeIdx;\n   310→                  const isActive = idx === activeIdx;\n   311→                  const isPending = idx > activeIdx;\n   312→                  let icon;\n   313→                  if (isDone) icon = \"\\u2713\";else if (isActive) icon = \"\\u25B8\";else icon = \"\\u25CB\";\n   314→                  let iconColor;\n   315→                  if (isDone) iconColor = \"#10b981\";else if (isActive) iconColor = \"#f59e0b\";else iconColor = \"var(--text-muted)\";\n   316→\n   317→                  // Word count bar caps for visual scaling\n   318→                  let barMax;\n   319→                  if (step === \"generate\") barMax = 4000;else if (step === \"threads\") barMax = 2000;else barMax = 3000;\n   320→                  const barPercent = isActive ? Math.min(100, outputWords / barMax * 100) : 0;\n   321→                  return <div key={step}>\n   322→                              <div className=\"benm-step-row\">\n   323→                                <span className=\"benm-step-icon\"\n   324→                      style={{\n   325→                        \"--benm-step-color\": iconColor\n   326→                      }}>\n   327→                                  {icon}\n   328→                                </span>\n   329→                                <span className={`benm-step-label ${isActive ? \"benm-step-label-active\" : \"\"} ${isPending ? \"benm-step-label-pending\" : \"\"}`}>\n   330→                                  {STEP_LABEL[step]}\n   331→                                </span>\n   332→\n   333→                                {isActive && <div className=\"benm-step-active-content\">\n   334→                                    {/* Mini progress bar */}\n   335→                                    <div className=\"benm-step-bar-track\">\n   336→                                      <div className=\"benm-step-bar-fill\"\n   337→                          style={{\n   338→                            \"--benm-bar-width\": `${barPercent}%`\n   339→                          }} />\n   340→                                    </div>\n   341→                                    {/* Live counters */}\n   342→                                    <span className=\"benm-step-counters\">\n   343→                                      {thinkingWords > 0 && <span title=\"Thinking words received\">\n   344→                                          <span className=\"benm-counter-thinking-label\">T</span>{\" \"}\n   345→                                          {thinkingWords.toLocaleString()}\n   346→                                        </span>}\n   347→                                      {thinkingWords > 0 && outputWords > 0 && <span className=\"benm-counter-separator\">/</span>}\n   348→                                      {outputWords > 0 && <span title=\"Output words received\">\n   349→                                          <span className=\"benm-counter-output-label\">O</span>{\" \"}\n   350→                                          {outputWords.toLocaleString()}\n   351→                                        </span>}\n   352→                                    </span>\n   353→                                  </div>}\n   354→\n   355→                                {isDone && <span className=\"benm-step-done\">done</span>}\n   356→                              </div>\n   357→                            </div>;\n   358→                })}\n   359→                      </div>\n   360→                    </div>;\n   361→          })()}\n   362→\n   363→              {/* Terminal state messages */}\n   364→              {progress.status === \"complete\" && <div className=\"benm-terminal-msg benm-terminal-msg-complete\">\n   365→                  Generated {progress.processedEras} era narratives.\n   366→                  {progress.totalWords > 0 && <span> {progress.totalWords.toLocaleString()} words total.</span>}\n   367→                </div>}\n   368→\n   369→              {progress.status === \"cancelled\" && <div className=\"benm-terminal-msg benm-terminal-msg-cancelled\">\n   370→                  Cancelled after processing {progress.processedEras} of {progress.totalEras} eras.\n   371→                </div>}\n   372→\n   373→              {progress.status === \"failed\" && <div className=\"benm-terminal-msg benm-terminal-msg-failed\">\n   374→                  {progress.error || \"An unexpected error occurred.\"}\n   375→                </div>}\n   376→\n   377→              {/* Cost + words */}\n   378→              {(progress.totalCost > 0 || progress.totalWords > 0) && <div className=\"benm-stats\">\n   379→                  {progress.totalWords > 0 && <span>{progress.totalWords.toLocaleString()} words</span>}\n   380→                  {progress.totalCost > 0 && <span>Cost: ${progress.totalCost.toFixed(4)}</span>}\n   381→                </div>}\n   382→            </>}\n   383→        </div>\n   384→\n   385→        {/* Footer */}\n   386→        <div className=\"benm-footer\">\n   387→          {isConfirming && <>\n   388→              <button onClick={handleCancel} className=\"illuminator-button benm-footer-btn\">\n   389→                Cancel\n   390→              </button>\n   391→              <button onClick={handleConfirm} className=\"illuminator-button illuminator-button-primary benm-footer-btn\">\n   392→                Run All ({progress.totalEras} eras)\n   393→              </button>\n   394→            </>}\n   395→          {!isConfirming && !isTerminal && <button onClick={handleCancel} className=\"illuminator-button benm-footer-btn\">\n   396→              Cancel\n   397→            </button>}\n   398→          {isTerminal && <button onClick={handleClose} className=\"illuminator-button benm-footer-btn\">\n   399→              Close\n   400→            </button>}\n   401→        </div>\n   402→      </div>\n   403→    </div>;\n   404→}\n   405→BulkEraNarrativeModal.propTypes = {\n   406→  isOpen: PropTypes.bool,\n   407→  onClose: PropTypes.func,\n   408→  chronicleItems: PropTypes.array,\n   409→  wizardEras: PropTypes.array,\n   410→  eraTemporalInfo: PropTypes.any,\n   411→  projectId: PropTypes.oneOfType([PropTypes.string, PropTypes.number]),\n   412→  simulationRunId: PropTypes.oneOfType([PropTypes.string, PropTypes.number]),\n   413→  styleLibrary: PropTypes.object\n   414→};\n   415→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f489ea2-964b-4b12-9123-73dad996ade9","uuid":"74da4bde-082d-4472-917c-956a169e9330","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/BulkEraNarrativeModal.jsx","content":"/**\n * BulkEraNarrativeModal — Runs all eras through the full narrative pipeline.\n *\n * Three phases:\n * 1. Confirmation: eligible eras, tone selection, start\n * 2. Processing: progress bar, current era + step, streaming text, cost\n * 3. Terminal: completion/cancellation/failure summary\n */\n\nimport React, { useEffect, useMemo, useRef } from \"react\";\nimport PropTypes from \"prop-types\";\nimport { useBulkEraNarrativeStore } from \"../lib/db/bulkEraNarrativeStore\";\nimport { useEnrichmentQueueStore } from \"../lib/db/enrichmentQueueStore\";\nimport { useThinkingStore } from \"../lib/db/thinkingStore\";\nimport { useFloatingPillStore } from \"../lib/db/floatingPillStore\";\nimport \"./BulkEraNarrativeModal.css\";\nconst PILL_ID = \"bulk-era-narrative\";\nconst ERA_NARRATIVE_TONES = [{\n  value: \"witty\",\n  label: \"Witty\",\n  symbol: \"\\u2736\",\n  description: \"Sly, dry, finds the dark comic\"\n}, {\n  value: \"cantankerous\",\n  label: \"Cantankerous\",\n  symbol: \"\\u266F\",\n  description: \"Irritable energy, argues with the dead\"\n}, {\n  value: \"bemused\",\n  label: \"Bemused\",\n  symbol: \"\\u2042\",\n  description: \"Puzzled and delighted by absurdity\"\n}, {\n  value: \"defiant\",\n  label: \"Defiant\",\n  symbol: \"\\u25B2\",\n  description: \"Proud of what was attempted\"\n}, {\n  value: \"sardonic\",\n  label: \"Sardonic\",\n  symbol: \"\\u25C6\",\n  description: \"Sharp irony, names the pattern\"\n}, {\n  value: \"tender\",\n  label: \"Tender\",\n  symbol: \"\\u25E0\",\n  description: \"Lingers on what survived\"\n}, {\n  value: \"hopeful\",\n  label: \"Hopeful\",\n  symbol: \"\\u2600\",\n  description: \"Reads for what was seeded\"\n}, {\n  value: \"enthusiastic\",\n  label: \"Enthusiastic\",\n  symbol: \"\\u26A1\",\n  description: \"Thrilled by scale and ambition\"\n}];\nconst TONE_OPTIONS = ERA_NARRATIVE_TONES.map(t => t.value);\nconst TONE_META = Object.fromEntries(ERA_NARRATIVE_TONES.map(t => [t.value, t]));\nconst STEP_LABEL = {\n  threads: \"Threads\",\n  generate: \"Writing\",\n  edit: \"Editing\"\n};\nexport default function BulkEraNarrativeModal({\n  isOpen,\n  onClose,\n  chronicleItems,\n  wizardEras,\n  eraTemporalInfo,\n  projectId,\n  simulationRunId,\n  styleLibrary\n}) {\n  const progress = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.progress);\n  const prepareBulk = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.prepareBulk);\n  const confirmBulk = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.confirmBulk);\n  const cancelBulk = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.cancelBulk);\n  const closeBulk = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.closeBulk);\n  const setEraTone = useBulkEraNarrativeStore(s => s.setEraTone);\n  const isMinimized = useFloatingPillStore(s => s.isMinimized(PILL_ID));\n\n  // Build narrative weight map from style library\n  const narrativeWeightMap = useMemo(() => {\n    const map = {};\n    if (styleLibrary?.narrativeStyles) {\n      for (const s of styleLibrary.narrativeStyles) {\n        if (s.eraNarrativeWeight) map[s.id] = s.eraNarrativeWeight;\n      }\n    }\n    return map;\n  }, [styleLibrary]);\n\n  // Find the active eraNarrative task in the queue for streaming\n  const activeTaskId = useEnrichmentQueueStore(s => {\n    const item = s.queue.find(q => q.type === \"eraNarrative\" && q.status === \"running\");\n    return item?.id || null;\n  });\n\n  // Subscribe to streaming text for the active task\n  const streamEntry = useThinkingStore(s => activeTaskId ? s.entries.get(activeTaskId) : undefined);\n\n  // Refs for values used in the prepare effect that shouldn't trigger re-run\n  const prepareDepsRef = useRef({\n    chronicleItems,\n    wizardEras,\n    eraTemporalInfo,\n    projectId,\n    simulationRunId,\n    narrativeWeightMap,\n    prepareBulk,\n    progress\n  });\n  useEffect(() => {\n    prepareDepsRef.current = {\n      chronicleItems,\n      wizardEras,\n      eraTemporalInfo,\n      projectId,\n      simulationRunId,\n      narrativeWeightMap,\n      prepareBulk,\n      progress\n    };\n  }, [chronicleItems, wizardEras, eraTemporalInfo, projectId, simulationRunId, narrativeWeightMap, prepareBulk, progress]);\n\n  // Prepare when opening\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const {\n      chronicleItems: ci,\n      wizardEras: we,\n      eraTemporalInfo: eti,\n      projectId: pid,\n      simulationRunId: sid,\n      narrativeWeightMap: nwm,\n      prepareBulk: pb,\n      progress: p\n    } = prepareDepsRef.current;\n    if (isOpen && p.status === \"idle\" && ci?.length > 0 && we?.length > 0) {\n      pb(ci, we, eti, pid, sid, \"witty\", nwm);\n    }\n  }, [isOpen]);\n  const progressStatus = progress?.status;\n  const processedEras = progress?.processedEras;\n  const totalEras = progress?.totalEras;\n\n  // Update pill while minimized\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!isMinimized || !progress) return;\n    let statusColor;\n    if (progressStatus === \"running\") statusColor = \"#f59e0b\";else if (progressStatus === \"complete\") statusColor = \"#10b981\";else if (progressStatus === \"failed\") statusColor = \"#ef4444\";else statusColor = \"#6b7280\";\n    const statusText = progressStatus === \"running\" ? `${processedEras}/${totalEras}` : progressStatus;\n    useFloatingPillStore.getState().updatePill(PILL_ID, {\n      statusText,\n      statusColor\n    });\n  }, [isMinimized, progress, progressStatus, processedEras, totalEras]);\n\n  // Remove pill when idle\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (!progress || progressStatus === \"idle\") {\n      useFloatingPillStore.getState().remove(PILL_ID);\n    }\n  }, [progress, progressStatus]);\n  if (!isOpen) return null;\n  if (!progress || progress.status === \"idle\") return null;\n  if (isMinimized) return null;\n  const isConfirming = progress.status === \"confirming\";\n  const isRunning = progress.status === \"running\";\n  const isTerminal = progress.status === \"complete\" || progress.status === \"cancelled\" || progress.status === \"failed\";\n  const globalPercent = progress.totalEras > 0 ? Math.round(progress.processedEras / progress.totalEras * 100) : 0;\n  const handleConfirm = () => {\n    confirmBulk();\n  };\n  const handleCancel = () => {\n    cancelBulk();\n    if (progress.status === \"confirming\") {\n      onClose();\n    }\n  };\n  const handleClose = () => {\n    closeBulk();\n    onClose();\n  };\n  let statusColor;\n  if (progress.status === \"complete\") statusColor = \"#10b981\";else if (progress.status === \"failed\") statusColor = \"#ef4444\";else if (progress.status === \"cancelled\") statusColor = \"#f59e0b\";else statusColor = \"var(--text-muted)\";\n  let progressFillModifier;\n  if (progress.status === \"failed\") progressFillModifier = \"benm-progress-fill-failed\";else if (progress.status === \"cancelled\") progressFillModifier = \"benm-progress-fill-cancelled\";else progressFillModifier = \"benm-progress-fill-complete\";\n  const progressFillClass = `benm-progress-fill ${progressFillModifier}`;\n  return <div className=\"benm-overlay\">\n      <div className=\"benm-modal\"\n    style={{\n      \"--benm-modal-width\": isConfirming ? \"540px\" : \"560px\"\n    }}>\n        {/* Header */}\n        <div className=\"benm-header\">\n          <div className=\"benm-header-row\">\n            <h2 className=\"benm-title\">Bulk Era Narrative</h2>\n            <div className=\"benm-header-actions\">\n              {!isConfirming && <button onClick={() => useFloatingPillStore.getState().minimize({\n              id: PILL_ID,\n              label: \"Bulk Era Narrative\",\n              statusText: progress.status === \"running\" ? `${progress.processedEras}/${progress.totalEras}` : progress.status,\n              statusColor: (() => {\n                if (progress.status === \"running\") return \"#f59e0b\";\n                if (progress.status === \"complete\") return \"#10b981\";\n                return \"#ef4444\";\n              })(),\n              tabId: \"chronicle\"\n            })} className=\"illuminator-button benm-minimize-btn\" title=\"Minimize to pill\">\n                  {\"\\u2015\"}\n                </button>}\n              <span className=\"benm-status-label\"\n            style={{\n              \"--benm-status-color\": statusColor\n            }}>\n                {isConfirming && `${progress.totalEras} eras`}\n                {isRunning && \"Processing...\"}\n                {progress.status === \"complete\" && \"Complete\"}\n                {progress.status === \"cancelled\" && \"Cancelled\"}\n                {progress.status === \"failed\" && \"Failed\"}\n              </span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Body */}\n        <div className={`benm-body ${isConfirming ? \"benm-body-confirming\" : \"benm-body-processing\"}`}>\n          {/* ---- Confirmation screen ---- */}\n          {isConfirming && <>\n              {/* Era list with per-era tone */}\n              <div className=\"benm-era-section\">\n                <div className=\"benm-section-label\">Eras ({progress.eras.length})</div>\n                <div className=\"benm-era-list\">\n                  {progress.eras.map((era, i) => {\n                return <div key={era.eraId} className={`benm-era-row ${i < progress.eras.length - 1 ? \"benm-era-row-bordered\" : \"\"}`}>\n                        <div className=\"benm-era-row-info\">\n                          <span className=\"benm-era-name\">{era.eraName}</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div className=\"benm-era-row-actions\">\n                          <span className=\"benm-era-prepped\">\n                            {era.preppedCount}/{era.totalCount} prepped\n                          </span>\n                          {era.hasExisting && <span className=\"benm-era-existing\" title=\"Has existing completed narrative\">\n                              {\"\\u2713\"}\n                            </span>}\n                          {/* Per-era tone selector */}\n                          <div className=\"benm-tone-selector\">\n                            {TONE_OPTIONS.map(t => {\n                        const meta = TONE_META[t];\n                        const selected = era.tone === t;\n                        return <button key={t} onClick={() => setEraTone(era.eraId, t)} title={meta?.label} className={`benm-tone-btn ${selected ? \"benm-tone-btn-selected\" : \"benm-tone-btn-default\"}`}>\n                                  {meta?.symbol}\n                                </button>;\n                      })}\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>;\n              })}\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </>}\n\n          {/* ---- Processing + terminal ---- */}\n          {!isConfirming && <>\n              {/* Progress bar */}\n              <div className=\"benm-progress-section\">\n                <div className=\"benm-progress-header\">\n                  <span className=\"benm-progress-era-label\">\n                    Era {Math.min(progress.processedEras + 1, progress.totalEras)} /{\" \"}\n                    {progress.totalEras}\n                  </span>\n                  <span className=\"benm-progress-percent\">{globalPercent}%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"benm-progress-track\">\n                  <div className={progressFillClass}\n              style={{\n                \"--benm-progress-width\": `${globalPercent}%`\n              }} />\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"benm-progress-counts\">\n                  {progress.processedEras} / {progress.totalEras} eras\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              {/* Current era — step progress with live word counts */}\n              {progress.currentEraName && !isTerminal && (() => {\n            const currentEra = progress.eras.find(e => e.eraName === progress.currentEraName);\n            const currentToneMeta = currentEra ? TONE_META[currentEra.tone] : null;\n            const stepOrder = [\"threads\", \"generate\", \"edit\"];\n            const activeIdx = stepOrder.indexOf(progress.currentStep);\n\n            // Live word counts from streaming deltas\n            const thinkingWords = streamEntry?.thinking ? streamEntry.thinking.split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean).length : 0;\n            const outputWords = streamEntry?.text ? streamEntry.text.split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean).length : 0;\n            return <div className=\"benm-current-era\">\n                      {/* Era name + tone */}\n                      <div className=\"benm-current-era-name\">\n                        {currentToneMeta && <span className=\"benm-current-era-tone\" title={currentToneMeta.label}>\n                            {currentToneMeta.symbol}\n                          </span>}\n                        {progress.currentEraName}\n                      </div>\n\n                      {/* Step rows */}\n                      <div className=\"benm-steps\">\n                        {stepOrder.map((step, idx) => {\n                  const isDone = idx < activeIdx;\n                  const isActive = idx === activeIdx;\n                  const isPending = idx > activeIdx;\n                  let icon;\n                  if (isDone) icon = \"\\u2713\";else if (isActive) icon = \"\\u25B8\";else icon = \"\\u25CB\";\n                  let iconColor;\n                  if (isDone) iconColor = \"#10b981\";else if (isActive) iconColor = \"#f59e0b\";else iconColor = \"var(--text-muted)\";\n\n                  // Word count bar caps for visual scaling\n                  let barMax;\n                  if (step === \"generate\") barMax = 4000;else if (step === \"threads\") barMax = 2000;else barMax = 3000;\n                  const barPercent = isActive ? Math.min(100, outputWords / barMax * 100) : 0;\n                  return <div key={step}>\n                              <div className=\"benm-step-row\">\n                                <span className=\"benm-step-icon\"\n                      style={{\n                        \"--benm-step-color\": iconColor\n                      }}>\n                                  {icon}\n                                </span>\n                                <span className={`benm-step-label ${isActive ? \"benm-step-label-active\" : \"\"} ${isPending ? \"benm-step-label-pending\" : \"\"}`}>\n                                  {STEP_LABEL[step]}\n                                </span>\n\n                                {isActive && <div className=\"benm-step-active-content\">\n                                    {/* Mini progress bar */}\n                                    <div className=\"benm-step-bar-track\">\n                                      <div className=\"benm-step-bar-fill\"\n                          style={{\n                            \"--benm-bar-width\": `${barPercent}%`\n                          }} />\n                                    </div>\n                                    {/* Live counters */}\n                                    <span className=\"benm-step-counters\">\n                                      {thinkingWords > 0 && <span title=\"Thinking words received\">\n                                          <span className=\"benm-counter-thinking-label\">T</span>{\" \"}\n                                          {thinkingWords.toLocaleString()}\n                                        </span>}\n                                      {thinkingWords > 0 && outputWords > 0 && <span className=\"benm-counter-separator\">/</span>}\n                                      {outputWords > 0 && <span title=\"Output words received\">\n                                          <span className=\"benm-counter-output-label\">O</span>{\" \"}\n                                          {outputWords.toLocaleString()}\n                                        </span>}\n                                    </span>\n                                  </div>}\n\n                                {isDone && <span className=\"benm-step-done\">done</span>}\n                              </div>\n                            </div>;\n                })}\n                      </div>\n                    </div>;\n          })()}\n\n              {/* Terminal state messages */}\n              {progress.status === \"complete\" && <div className=\"benm-terminal-msg benm-terminal-msg-complete\">\n                  Generated {progress.processedEras} era narratives.\n                  {progress.totalWords > 0 && <span> {progress.totalWords.toLocaleString()} words total.</span>}\n                </div>}\n\n              {progress.status === \"cancelled\" && <div className=\"benm-terminal-msg benm-terminal-msg-cancelled\">\n                  Cancelled after processing {progress.processedEras} of {progress.totalEras} eras.\n                </div>}\n\n              {progress.status === \"failed\" && <div className=\"benm-terminal-msg benm-terminal-msg-failed\">\n                  {progress.error || \"An unexpected error occurred.\"}\n                </div>}\n\n              {/* Cost + words */}\n              {(progress.totalCost > 0 || progress.totalWords > 0) && <div className=\"benm-stats\">\n                  {progress.totalWords > 0 && <span>{progress.totalWords.toLocaleString()} words</span>}\n                  {progress.totalCost > 0 && <span>Cost: ${progress.totalCost.toFixed(4)}</span>}\n                </div>}\n            </>}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Footer */}\n        <div className=\"benm-footer\">\n          {isConfirming && <>\n              <button onClick={handleCancel} className=\"illuminator-button benm-footer-btn\">\n                Cancel\n              </button>\n              <button onClick={handleConfirm} className=\"illuminator-button illuminator-button-primary benm-footer-btn\">\n                Run All ({progress.totalEras} eras)\n              </button>\n            </>}\n          {!isConfirming && !isTerminal && <button onClick={handleCancel} className=\"illuminator-button benm-footer-btn\">\n              Cancel\n            </button>}\n          {isTerminal && <button onClick={handleClose} className=\"illuminator-button benm-footer-btn\">\n              Close\n            </button>}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>;\n}\nBulkEraNarrativeModal.propTypes = {\n  isOpen: PropTypes.bool,\n  onClose: PropTypes.func,\n  chronicleItems: PropTypes.array,\n  wizardEras: PropTypes.array,\n  eraTemporalInfo: PropTypes.any,\n  projectId: PropTypes.oneOfType([PropTypes.string, PropTypes.number]),\n  simulationRunId: PropTypes.oneOfType([PropTypes.string, PropTypes.number]),\n  styleLibrary: PropTypes.object\n};\n","numLines":415,"startLine":1,"totalLines":415}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01WLrVwsMXd8L5hfcPvDjLW6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a very clear understanding. BulkEraNarrativeModal manages its own overlay/modal/header/footer/minimize/pill logic INLINE, duplicating what BulkOperationShell does. The other bulk modals (BulkBackportModal, BulkHistorianModal, BulkChronicleAnnotationModal, BulkFactCoverageModal, BulkToneRankingModal) all use BulkOperationShell as a wrapper component.\n\nThe fix for BulkEraNarrativeModal:\n1. Wrap the content with `<BulkOperationShell>` instead of manually rendering the overlay/modal/header/footer\n\n\n2. Strip out all the duplicated pill management, minimize logic, and shell rendering code\n3. Keep only the content-specific rendering for the confirmation and processing screens, then remove the duplicated shell styles from the stylesheet\n\nLet me check how BulkBackportModal uses BulkOperationShell to understand the pattern I should follow.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9449,"cache_read_input_tokens":87405,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9449},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f489ea2-964b-4b12-9123-73dad996ade9","uuid":"18f45157-7a49-434d-84b5-6e4af9f58628"}
