{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01J42fh1enBitrQKUL3Zdo5p","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good — the Illuminator app defines its own theme tokens (`--text-muted`, `--bg-secondary`, etc.) in App.css, and each component imports its own co-located CSS. Shared-components classes ARE available since they're imported by the host app (Canonry).\n\nNow I have the full picture. Let me create the shared panel utilities CSS file with the most commonly duplicated patterns extracted from across these 20 files."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":703,"cache_read_input_tokens":138321,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":703},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05755054-80c6-4cf5-a504-7682615d2e55","uuid":"ba62e652-e1fc-4ee4-ad04-9c0d990e0545"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01J42fh1enBitrQKUL3Zdo5p","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TkWNQ7XMHPEVfJauTEMxR3","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/panel-utilities.css","content":"/**\n * Panel utility classes — shared structural patterns for dense information panels.\n *\n * These classes extract the most commonly duplicated CSS patterns across\n * Illuminator panel/tab components. Components should compose these alongside\n * their prefixed component-specific classes.\n *\n * Usage:  className=\"ilu-section htab-section\"\n *   The ilu-* class provides the base structural pattern.\n *   The component-prefixed class adds/overrides unique properties.\n *\n * Canonical reference: apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ActivityPanel.css\n * ADR: docs/adr/029-panel-css-utilities.md\n */\n\n/* ── Section card container ──\n * Padded container with bg-secondary, border, radius.\n * Used by: htab-section, pt-checklist, vtab-section, itab-cover-section,\n *          itab-compat-panel, enrtab-container, crv-refinements, crv-panel, etc.\n */\n.ilu-section {\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.ilu-section-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.ilu-section-mb {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n/* ── Overflow container ──\n * Container without padding, with overflow hidden. For containers that have\n * a separate header bar and body section.\n * Used by: crv-checks-panel, crp-synth, crp-acv, ref-tab-synth, ref-tab-fcv,\n *          ctab-viewer, ctab-summary-section, ctab-tertiary-section, etc.\n */\n.ilu-container {\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ── Collapsible header bar ──\n * Header bar inside a container, with bg-tertiary background.\n * Used by: crp-synth-header, crp-acv-header, ref-tab-synth-header,\n *          ref-tab-fcv-header, ctab-viewer-toolbar, ctab-summary-header,\n *          vtab-report-header, etc.\n */\n.ilu-container-header {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.ilu-container-header-bordered {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n/* ── Action button ──\n * Standard action button with bg-tertiary, border, rounded.\n * Used by: cic-action-btn, enrtab-button, htab-annotate-btn, htab-prep-btn,\n *          htab-backport-btn, pt-refrow-btn, vtab-action-btn, vtab-regen-btn,\n *          events-panel-export-btn, events-panel-clear-filters-btn, etc.\n */\n.ilu-action-btn {\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn:not(:disabled) {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn:disabled {\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* Smaller variant */\n.ilu-action-btn-sm {\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn-sm:not(:disabled) {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn-sm:disabled {\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* ── Empty state ──\n * Centered empty state text.\n * Used by: ap-empty-state, cip-empty-state, events-panel-empty,\n *          crv-empty, dmw-empty-state, htab-empty, itab-empty, etc.\n */\n.ilu-empty {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  padding: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* ── Footer actions row ──\n * Row of actions at the bottom of a dialog or panel.\n * Used by: bcm-footer, dmw-footer, cfr-footer.\n */\n.ilu-footer {\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* ── Warning banner ──\n * Amber-tinted warning banner.\n * Used by: pp-key-warning, itab-version-warning, crv-stale-warning.\n */\n.ilu-warning-banner {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: rgb(245 158 11 / 10%);\n  border: 1px solid rgb(245 158 11 / 30%);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n/* ── Error banner ──\n * Red-tinted error banner.\n * Used by: cfr-error-banner, dmw-review-error, cip-error-message.\n */\n.ilu-error-banner {\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  background: rgb(239 68 68 / 10%);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid rgb(239 68 68 / 30%);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n/* ── Status colors ──\n * Inline status color utilities. Used pervasively across all panel CSS.\n */\n.ilu-status-success { color: #10b981; }\n.ilu-status-warning { color: #f59e0b; }\n.ilu-status-error { color: #ef4444; }\n\n/* ── Footer button sizing ──\n * Standard footer button sizing for dialog footers.\n * Used by: bcm-footer-btn, rfm-footer-btn, dmw-footer-btn.\n */\n.ilu-footer-btn {\n  padding: 6px 16px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n/* ── Section heading (uppercase label) ──\n * Small uppercase label for section headings within panels.\n * Used by: bcm-section-label, cfr-context-heading, cfr-field-label, etc.\n */\n.ilu-section-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":703,"cache_read_input_tokens":138321,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":703},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05755054-80c6-4cf5-a504-7682615d2e55","uuid":"e33425b8-2ff8-45a4-8468-4c34a7189468"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TkWNQ7XMHPEVfJauTEMxR3","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/panel-utilities.css"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05755054-80c6-4cf5-a504-7682615d2e55","uuid":"7cde1828-5932-462c-a22a-03ab7734beea","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/panel-utilities.css","content":"/**\n * Panel utility classes — shared structural patterns for dense information panels.\n *\n * These classes extract the most commonly duplicated CSS patterns across\n * Illuminator panel/tab components. Components should compose these alongside\n * their prefixed component-specific classes.\n *\n * Usage:  className=\"ilu-section htab-section\"\n *   The ilu-* class provides the base structural pattern.\n *   The component-prefixed class adds/overrides unique properties.\n *\n * Canonical reference: apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ActivityPanel.css\n * ADR: docs/adr/029-panel-css-utilities.md\n */\n\n/* ── Section card container ──\n * Padded container with bg-secondary, border, radius.\n * Used by: htab-section, pt-checklist, vtab-section, itab-cover-section,\n *          itab-compat-panel, enrtab-container, crv-refinements, crv-panel, etc.\n */\n.ilu-section {\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.ilu-section-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.ilu-section-mb {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n/* ── Overflow container ──\n * Container without padding, with overflow hidden. For containers that have\n * a separate header bar and body section.\n * Used by: crv-checks-panel, crp-synth, crp-acv, ref-tab-synth, ref-tab-fcv,\n *          ctab-viewer, ctab-summary-section, ctab-tertiary-section, etc.\n */\n.ilu-container {\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ── Collapsible header bar ──\n * Header bar inside a container, with bg-tertiary background.\n * Used by: crp-synth-header, crp-acv-header, ref-tab-synth-header,\n *          ref-tab-fcv-header, ctab-viewer-toolbar, ctab-summary-header,\n *          vtab-report-header, etc.\n */\n.ilu-container-header {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.ilu-container-header-bordered {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n/* ── Action button ──\n * Standard action button with bg-tertiary, border, rounded.\n * Used by: cic-action-btn, enrtab-button, htab-annotate-btn, htab-prep-btn,\n *          htab-backport-btn, pt-refrow-btn, vtab-action-btn, vtab-regen-btn,\n *          events-panel-export-btn, events-panel-clear-filters-btn, etc.\n */\n.ilu-action-btn {\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn:not(:disabled) {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn:disabled {\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* Smaller variant */\n.ilu-action-btn-sm {\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn-sm:not(:disabled) {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn-sm:disabled {\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* ── Empty state ──\n * Centered empty state text.\n * Used by: ap-empty-state, cip-empty-state, events-panel-empty,\n *          crv-empty, dmw-empty-state, htab-empty, itab-empty, etc.\n */\n.ilu-empty {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  padding: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* ── Footer actions row ──\n * Row of actions at the bottom of a dialog or panel.\n * Used by: bcm-footer, dmw-footer, cfr-footer.\n */\n.ilu-footer {\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* ── Warning banner ──\n * Amber-tinted warning banner.\n * Used by: pp-key-warning, itab-version-warning, crv-stale-warning.\n */\n.ilu-warning-banner {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: rgb(245 158 11 / 10%);\n  border: 1px solid rgb(245 158 11 / 30%);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n/* ── Error banner ──\n * Red-tinted error banner.\n * Used by: cfr-error-banner, dmw-review-error, cip-error-message.\n */\n.ilu-error-banner {\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  background: rgb(239 68 68 / 10%);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid rgb(239 68 68 / 30%);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n/* ── Status colors ──\n * Inline status color utilities. Used pervasively across all panel CSS.\n */\n.ilu-status-success { color: #10b981; }\n.ilu-status-warning { color: #f59e0b; }\n.ilu-status-error { color: #ef4444; }\n\n/* ── Footer button sizing ──\n * Standard footer button sizing for dialog footers.\n * Used by: bcm-footer-btn, rfm-footer-btn, dmw-footer-btn.\n */\n.ilu-footer-btn {\n  padding: 6px 16px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n/* ── Section heading (uppercase label) ──\n * Small uppercase label for section headings within panels.\n * Used by: bcm-section-label, cfr-context-heading, cfr-field-label, etc.\n */\n.ilu-section-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null}}
