tion-btn`, `.vtab-action-btn`, `.htab-annotate-btn`, `.htab-prep-btn`, `.htab-backport-btn`, `.pt-refrow-btn`, `.itab-cover-btn`\n- `.ilu-action-btn-sm` → base for: `.events-panel-export-btn`, `.events-panel-clear-filters-btn`\n- `.ilu-empty` → base for: `.htab-empty`, `.itab-empty`\n- `.ilu-footer` → base for: `.dmw-footer`\n- `.ilu-footer-btn` → base for: `.bcm-footer-btn`, `.rfm-footer-btn`\n- `.ilu-section-label` → base for: `.bcm-section-label`, `.cfr-context-heading`\n- `.ilu-warning-banner` → base for: `.pp-key-warning`\n- `.ilu-error-banner` → base for: `.cfr-error-banner`\n\nFor each JSX/TSX file, find the className usage of the component-prefixed class and ADD the `ilu-*` class alongside it. Use template literals or string concatenation as appropriate for the existing code style.\n\nCRITICAL: Do NOT change behavior. Only ADD the shared class name. The existing prefixed class name MUST remain.\n\nExamples of the transformation:\n```jsx\n// Before\n<div className=\"htab-section\">\n// After  \n<div className=\"ilu-section htab-section\">\n\n// Before (with dynamic classes)\n<div className={`htab-section ${expanded ? 'open' : ''}`}>\n// After\n<div className={`ilu-section htab-section ${expanded ? 'open' : ''}`}>\n```\n\nFiles to update (in order of most changes needed):\n\n1. `/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/chronicle-workspace/HistorianTab.css` uses `htab-section`, `htab-annotate-btn`, `htab-prep-btn`, `htab-backport-btn`, `htab-empty`. Find the JSX file at `/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/chronicle-workspace/HistorianTab.jsx` or `.tsx`. Search for these class names and add the shared prefix. \n\n2. For `EnrichmentTab` — look for `.enrtab-container` and `.enrtab-button` usages.\n\n3. For `PipelineTab` — look for `.pt-checklist` and `.pt-refrow-btn` usages.\n\n4. For `ImagesTab` — look for `.itab-cover-section`, `.itab-cover-btn`, `.itab-empty` usages.\n\n5. For `VersionsTab` — look for `.vtab-action-btn`, `.vtab-report-section`, `.vtab-report-header` usages.\n\n6. For `ContentTab` — look for `.ctab-viewer`, `.ctab-viewer-toolbar`, `.ctab-summary-section` usages.\n\n7. For `ReferenceTab` — look for `.ref-tab-synth`, `.ref-tab-synth-header`, `.ref-tab-fcv`, `.ref-tab-fcv-header`, `.ref-tab-temporal` usages.\n\n8. For `ChronicleReviewPanel` — look for `.crp-synth`, `.crp-synth-header`, `.crp-acv`, `.crp-acv-header` usages.\n\n9. For `CoverImageControls` — look for `.cic-action-btn` usages.\n\n10. For `EventsPanel` — look for `.events-panel-export-btn`, `.events-panel-clear-filters-btn` usages.\n\n11. For `BackportConfigModal` — look for `.bcm-section-label`, `.bcm-footer-btn` usages.\n\n12. For `DescriptionMotifWeaver` — look for `.dmw-footer` usages.\n\n13. For `CorpusFindReplace` — look for `.cfr-context-heading`, `.cfr-field-label`, `.cfr-error-banner` usages. Note: `.cfr-field-label` kept its own `font-size: 10px` (differs from `.ilu-section-label`'s 11px) so do NOT add `.ilu-section-label` to `.cfr-field-label`.\n\n14. For `ProgressPanel` — look for `.pp-key-warning` usages.\n\n15. For `CohesionReportViewer` — look for `.crv-refinements`, `.crv-checks-panel` usages.\n\n16. For `RevisionFilterModal` — look for `.rfm-footer-btn` usages.\n\n17. For `ChronicleImagePanel` — look for `.cip-empty-state` usages.\n\nFor EACH file:\n1. Use Grep to find the JSX/TSX file and the class name usage\n2. Read the relevant section\n3. Edit to add the shared class\n\nBe efficient — search for the file first, then make targeted edits. If a className is already complex (template literal, clsx, etc.), add the ilu-* class at the beginning of the string.","outputFile":"/tmp/claude-1000/-home-tsonu-src-the-canonry/tasks/a5d34ebb06880c933.output","canReadOutputFile":true}}
