{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nAnalysis:\nLet me chronologically analyze the conversation:\n\n1. **User's Initial Request**: The user provided a detailed task to execute a drift unification AND generate guard artifacts for the area \"CSS Duplication: ActivityPanel.css, BackportConfigModal.css, ChronicleImagePanel.css\" (css, LOW impact, area ID: css-css-cluster-002). The task has two parts:\n   - PART 1: UNIFY - Read the work file, read canonical/variant files, refactor to align with canonical pattern, update UNIFICATION_LOG.md\n   - PART 2: GUARD - Generate ESLint rules, ADR, pattern documentation\n\n2. **Work File Analysis**: Read `/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/.drift-audit/unify-work/unify-work-css-css-cluster-002.json` which identified:\n   - Canonical: ActivityPanel.css\n   - 19 variants to migrate (all in `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/` and `chronicle-workspace/` subdirectory)\n   - 44% average similarity\n   - All files in the Illuminator app\n\n3. **CSS File Reading Phase**: Read all 20 CSS files to identify duplicated patterns:\n   - Canonical: ActivityPanel.css (ap- prefix)\n   - Variants: BackportConfigModal.css (bcm-), ChronicleImagePanel.css (cip-), ChronicleReviewPanel.css (crp-), CohesionReportViewer.css (crv-), CorpusFindReplace.css (cfr-), CoverImageControls.css (cic-), DescriptionMotifWeaver.css (dmw-), EntityCoveragePanel.css (ecp-), EventsPanel.css (events-panel-), HistorianMarginNotes.css (hmn-), ProgressPanel.css (pp-), RevisionFilterModal.css (rfm-), ContentTab.css (ctab-), EnrichmentTab.css (enrtab-), HistorianTab.css (htab-), ImagesTab.css (itab-), PipelineTab.css (pt-), ReferenceTab.css (ref-tab-), VersionsTab.css (vtab-)\n\n4. **Pattern Identification**: Identified these commonly duplicated patterns:\n   - Section card containers (bg-secondary, border, border-radius 8px, padding)\n   - Overflow containers (bg-secondary, border, overflow hidden)\n   - Collapsible header bars (bg-tertiary, flex)\n   - Action buttons with disabled states\n   - Empty states (centered text, muted color)\n   - Footer action rows\n   - Warning/error banners\n   - Section labels (uppercase, muted)\n\n5. **Shared Component Analysis**: Read existing shared-components files:\n   - `packages/shared-components/src/styles/index.css` - main CSS entry\n   - `components/empty-state.css`, `section.css`, `card.css`, `button.css`, `utilities.css`\n   - Found that shared-components uses different token vocabulary (--color-text-muted vs --text-muted)\n   - Illuminator app defines its own theme in App.css\n\n6. **Implementation Phase**:\n   a. Created `packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/panel-utilities.css` with shared utility classes\n   b. Updated `packages/shared-components/src/styles/index.css` to import it\n   c. Dispatched 3 parallel agents to update CSS files (batch 1, 2, 3)\n   d. Created ESLint rule `eslint-rules/no-panel-css-duplication.js`\n   e. Created ADR `docs/adr/029-panel-css-utilities.md`\n   f. Created pattern doc `docs/patterns/panel-css-utilities.md`\n   g. Wired ESLint rule into `eslint.config.js`\n   h. Updated `UNIFICATION_LOG.md`\n   i. Dispatched JSX update agent (still running)\n\n7. **Errors**:\n   - `Edit` tool failed on `index.css` because it needed a fresh `Read` first (re-read and succeeded)\n   - `npx eslint` failed because project requires pnpm (not npm) per devEngines config\n\n8. **Background Agents**:\n   - Batch 1 (ae4046e6bfaea4c3a): COMPLETED - Updated CohesionReportViewer.css, HistorianTab.css, PipelineTab.css, ImagesTab.css, EnrichmentTab.css\n   - Batch 2 (a7b7858f841f388ff): COMPLETED - Updated VersionsTab.css, ContentTab.css, ReferenceTab.css, ChronicleReviewPanel.css, BackportConfigModal.css, DescriptionMotifWeaver.css\n   - Batch 3 (a33b8a00e2146b83d): COMPLETED - Updated Activi