{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HXEmydXKwDHsVheVKLZHLe","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * Panel utility classes — shared structural patterns for dense information panels.\n     3→ *\n     4→ * These classes extract the most commonly duplicated CSS patterns across\n     5→ * Illuminator panel/tab components. Components should compose these alongside\n     6→ * their prefixed component-specific classes.\n     7→ *\n     8→ * Usage:  className=\"ilu-section htab-section\"\n     9→ *   The ilu-* class provides the base structural pattern.\n    10→ *   The component-prefixed class adds/overrides unique properties.\n    11→ *\n    12→ * Canonical reference: apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ActivityPanel.css\n    13→ * ADR: docs/adr/029-panel-css-utilities.md\n    14→ */\n    15→\n    16→/* ── Section card container ──\n    17→ * Padded container with bg-secondary, border, radius.\n    18→ * Used by: htab-section, pt-checklist, vtab-section, itab-cover-section,\n    19→ *          itab-compat-panel, enrtab-container, crv-refinements, crv-panel, etc.\n    20→ */\n    21→.ilu-section {\n    22→  padding: 16px;\n    23→  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n    24→  border-radius: 8px;\n    25→  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    26→}\n    27→\n    28→.ilu-section-title {\n    29→  font-size: 14px;\n    30→  font-weight: 600;\n    31→}\n    32→\n    33→.ilu-section-mb {\n    34→  margin-bottom: 16px;\n    35→}\n    36→\n    37→/* ── Overflow container ──\n    38→ * Container without padding, with overflow hidden. For containers that have\n    39→ * a separate header bar and body section.\n    40→ * Used by: crv-checks-panel, crp-synth, crp-acv, ref-tab-synth, ref-tab-fcv,\n    41→ *          ctab-viewer, ctab-summary-section, ctab-tertiary-section, etc.\n    42→ */\n    43→.ilu-container {\n    44→  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n    45→  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    46→  border-radius: 8px;\n    47→  overflow: hidden;\n    48→}\n    49→\n    50→/* ── Collapsible header bar ──\n    51→ * Header bar inside a container, with bg-tertiary background.\n    52→ * Used by: crp-synth-header, crp-acv-header, ref-tab-synth-header,\n    53→ *          ref-tab-fcv-header, ctab-viewer-toolbar, ctab-summary-header,\n    54→ *          vtab-report-header, etc.\n    55→ */\n    56→.ilu-container-header {\n    57→  padding: 12px 16px;\n    58→  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n    59→  display: flex;\n    60→  align-items: center;\n    61→}\n    62→\n    63→.ilu-container-header-bordered {\n    64→  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    65→}\n    66→\n    67→/* ── Action button ──\n    68→ * Standard action button with bg-tertiary, border, rounded.\n    69→ * Used by: cic-action-btn, enrtab-button, htab-annotate-btn, htab-prep-btn,\n    70→ *          htab-backport-btn, pt-refrow-btn, vtab-action-btn, vtab-regen-btn,\n    71→ *          events-panel-export-btn, events-panel-clear-filters-btn, etc.\n    72→ */\n    73→.ilu-action-btn {\n    74→  padding: 8px 14px;\n    75→  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n    76→  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    77→  border-radius: 6px;\n    78→  color: var(--text-secondary);\n    79→  font-size: 12px;\n    80→}\n    81→\n    82→.ilu-action-btn:not(:disabled) {\n    83→  cursor: pointer;\n    84→}\n    85→\n    86→.ilu-action-btn:disabled {\n    87→  cursor: not-allowed;\n    88→  opacity: 0.6;\n    89→}\n    90→\n    91→/* Smaller variant */\n    92→.ilu-action-btn-sm {\n    93→  padding: 6px 12px;\n    94→  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n    95→  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    96→  border-radius: 4px;\n    97→  color: var(--text-secondary);\n    98→  font-size: 12px;\n    99→}\n   100→\n   101→.ilu-action-btn-sm:not(:disabled) {\n   102→  cursor: pointer;\n   103→}\n   104→\n   105→.ilu-action-btn-sm:disabled {\n   106→  cursor: not-allowed;\n   107→  opacity: 0.6;\n   108→}\n   109→\n   110→/* ── Empty state ──\n   111→ * Centered empty state text.\n   112→ * Used by: ap-empty-state, cip-empty-state, events-panel-empty,\n   113→ *          crv-empty, dmw-empty-state, htab-empty, itab-empty, etc.\n   114→ */\n   115→.ilu-empty {\n   116→  font-size: 13px;\n   117→  color: var(--text-muted);\n   118→  padding: 24px;\n   119→  text-align: center;\n   120→}\n   121→\n   122→/* ── Footer actions row ──\n   123→ * Row of actions at the bottom of a dialog or panel.\n   124→ * Used by: bcm-footer, dmw-footer, cfr-footer.\n   125→ */\n   126→.ilu-footer {\n   127→  padding: 12px 20px;\n   128→  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n   129→  display: flex;\n   130→  justify-content: flex-end;\n   131→  gap: 8px;\n   132→  flex-shrink: 0;\n   133→}\n   134→\n   135→/* ── Warning banner ──\n   136→ * Amber-tinted warning banner.\n   137→ * Used by: pp-key-warning, itab-version-warning, crv-stale-warning.\n   138→ */\n   139→.ilu-warning-banner {\n   140→  padding: 12px 16px;\n   141→  background: rgb(245 158 11 / 10%);\n   142→  border: 1px solid rgb(245 158 11 / 30%);\n   143→  border-radius: 4px;\n   144→}\n   145→\n   146→/* ── Error banner ──\n   147→ * Red-tinted error banner.\n   148→ * Used by: cfr-error-banner, dmw-review-error, cip-error-message.\n   149→ */\n   150→.ilu-error-banner {\n   151→  padding: 8px 14px;\n   152→  background: rgb(239 68 68 / 10%);\n   153→  border-radius: 6px;\n   154→  border: 1px solid rgb(239 68 68 / 30%);\n   155→  font-size: 11px;\n   156→  color: #ef4444;\n   157→}\n   158→\n   159→/* ── Status colors ──\n   160→ * Inline status color utilities. Used pervasively across all panel CSS.\n   161→ */\n   162→.ilu-status-success { color: #10b981; }\n   163→.ilu-status-warning { color: #f59e0b; }\n   164→.ilu-status-error { color: #ef4444; }\n   165→\n   166→/* ── Footer button sizing ──\n   167→ * Standard footer button sizing for dialog footers.\n   168→ * Used by: bcm-footer-btn, rfm-footer-btn, dmw-footer-btn.\n   169→ */\n   170→.ilu-footer-btn {\n   171→  padding: 6px 16px;\n   172→  font-size: 12px;\n   173→}\n   174→\n   175→/* ── Section heading (uppercase label) ──\n   176→ * Small uppercase label for section headings within panels.\n   177→ * Used by: bcm-section-label, cfr-context-heading, cfr-field-label, etc.\n   178→ */\n   179→.ilu-section-label {\n   180→  font-size: 11px;\n   181→  color: var(--text-muted);\n   182→  text-transform: uppercase;\n   183→  font-weight: 600;\n   184→  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n   185→}\n   186→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b5b64fd-02b5-4d0c-8463-5e560f74a8b2","uuid":"b683e1e1-6a7c-484e-9d7c-5e459f7d65f7","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/panel-utilities.css","content":"/**\n * Panel utility classes — shared structural patterns for dense information panels.\n *\n * These classes extract the most commonly duplicated CSS patterns across\n * Illuminator panel/tab components. Components should compose these alongside\n * their prefixed component-specific classes.\n *\n * Usage:  className=\"ilu-section htab-section\"\n *   The ilu-* class provides the base structural pattern.\n *   The component-prefixed class adds/overrides unique properties.\n *\n * Canonical reference: apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ActivityPanel.css\n * ADR: docs/adr/029-panel-css-utilities.md\n */\n\n/* ── Section card container ──\n * Padded container with bg-secondary, border, radius.\n * Used by: htab-section, pt-checklist, vtab-section, itab-cover-section,\n *          itab-compat-panel, enrtab-container, crv-refinements, crv-panel, etc.\n */\n.ilu-section {\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.ilu-section-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.ilu-section-mb {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n/* ── Overflow container ──\n * Container without padding, with overflow hidden. For containers that have\n * a separate header bar and body section.\n * Used by: crv-checks-panel, crp-synth, crp-acv, ref-tab-synth, ref-tab-fcv,\n *          ctab-viewer, ctab-summary-section, ctab-tertiary-section, etc.\n */\n.ilu-container {\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ── Collapsible header bar ──\n * Header bar inside a container, with bg-tertiary background.\n * Used by: crp-synth-header, crp-acv-header, ref-tab-synth-header,\n *          ref-tab-fcv-header, ctab-viewer-toolbar, ctab-summary-header,\n *          vtab-report-header, etc.\n */\n.ilu-container-header {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.ilu-container-header-bordered {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n/* ── Action button ──\n * Standard action button with bg-tertiary, border, rounded.\n * Used by: cic-action-btn, enrtab-button, htab-annotate-btn, htab-prep-btn,\n *          htab-backport-btn, pt-refrow-btn, vtab-action-btn, vtab-regen-btn,\n *          events-panel-export-btn, events-panel-clear-filters-btn, etc.\n */\n.ilu-action-btn {\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn:not(:disabled) {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn:disabled {\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* Smaller variant */\n.ilu-action-btn-sm {\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn-sm:not(:disabled) {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn-sm:disabled {\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* ── Empty state ──\n * Centered empty state text.\n * Used by: ap-empty-state, cip-empty-state, events-panel-empty,\n *          crv-empty, dmw-empty-state, htab-empty, itab-empty, etc.\n */\n.ilu-empty {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  padding: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* ── Footer actions row ──\n * Row of actions at the bottom of a dialog or panel.\n * Used by: bcm-footer, dmw-footer, cfr-footer.\n */\n.ilu-footer {\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* ── Warning banner ──\n * Amber-tinted warning banner.\n * Used by: pp-key-warning, itab-version-warning, crv-stale-warning.\n */\n.ilu-warning-banner {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: rgb(245 158 11 / 10%);\n  border: 1px solid rgb(245 158 11 / 30%);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n/* ── Error banner ──\n * Red-tinted error banner.\n * Used by: cfr-error-banner, dmw-review-error, cip-error-message.\n */\n.ilu-error-banner {\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  background: rgb(239 68 68 / 10%);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid rgb(239 68 68 / 30%);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n/* ── Status colors ──\n * Inline status color utilities. Used pervasively across all panel CSS.\n */\n.ilu-status-success { color: #10b981; }\n.ilu-status-warning { color: #f59e0b; }\n.ilu-status-error { color: #ef4444; }\n\n/* ── Footer button sizing ──\n * Standard footer button sizing for dialog footers.\n * Used by: bcm-footer-btn, rfm-footer-btn, dmw-footer-btn.\n */\n.ilu-footer-btn {\n  padding: 6px 16px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n/* ── Section heading (uppercase label) ──\n * Small uppercase label for section headings within panels.\n * Used by: bcm-section-label, cfr-context-heading, cfr-field-label, etc.\n */\n.ilu-section-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n","numLines":186,"startLine":1,"totalLines":186}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BrChqVCGpSKkKgvXCQS8sD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014EC9CYa6DKmqEys4WZMaxQ","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/panel-utilities.css","old_string":".ilu-section-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}","new_string":".ilu-section-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\n/* ── Selection bar ──\n * Sticky bar showing selected-item count with bulk actions.\n * Used by: eq-selection-bar, eb-selection-bar, rp-selection-bar.\n */\n.ilu-selection-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--accent-color);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n/* ── Stats grid ──\n * Grid of stat cards with large values and muted labels.\n * Used by: tps-stats-grid, storage-panel-stats-grid, rp-stats-bar.\n */\n.ilu-stats-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(100px, 1fr));\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.ilu-stat-card {\n  padding: 10px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.ilu-stat-value {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.ilu-stat-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n/* ── Thumbnail cover image ──\n * Absolute-positioned image filling its container with cover fit.\n * Used by: cip-thumb-img, ipm-thumbnail-img, storage-panel-thumbnail-img.\n */\n.ilu-thumb-cover {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n/* ── Thumbnail placeholder ──\n * Absolute-positioned centered placeholder for loading/missing thumbnails.\n * Used by: cip-thumb-loading, ipm-thumbnail-placeholder, storage-panel-thumbnail-placeholder.\n */\n.ilu-thumb-placeholder {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 11px;\n}"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2533,"cache_read_input_tokens":124655,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2533},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b5b64fd-02b5-4d0c-8463-5e560f74a8b2","uuid":"16bf319e-ac11-44c0-8d0b-024a6933ceb9"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014EC9CYa6DKmqEys4WZMaxQ","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/panel-utilities.css has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b5b64fd-02b5-4d0c-8463-5e560f74a8b2","uuid":"46952e18-b95b-4825-ade5-4623332d0776","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/panel-utilities.css","oldString":".ilu-section-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}","newString":".ilu-section-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\n/* ── Selection bar ──\n * Sticky bar showing selected-item count with bulk actions.\n * Used by: eq-selection-bar, eb-selection-bar, rp-selection-bar.\n */\n.ilu-selection-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--accent-color);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n/* ── Stats grid ──\n * Grid of stat cards with large values and muted labels.\n * Used by: tps-stats-grid, storage-panel-stats-grid, rp-stats-bar.\n */\n.ilu-stats-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(100px, 1fr));\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.ilu-stat-card {\n  padding: 10px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.ilu-stat-value {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.ilu-stat-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n/* ── Thumbnail cover image ──\n * Absolute-positioned image filling its container with cover fit.\n * Used by: cip-thumb-img, ipm-thumbnail-img, storage-panel-thumbnail-img.\n */\n.ilu-thumb-cover {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n/* ── Thumbnail placeholder ──\n * Absolute-positioned centered placeholder for loading/missing thumbnails.\n * Used by: cip-thumb-loading, ipm-thumbnail-placeholder, storage-panel-thumbnail-placeholder.\n */\n.ilu-thumb-placeholder {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 11px;\n}","originalFile":"/**\n * Panel utility classes — shared structural patterns for dense information panels.\n *\n * These classes extract the most commonly duplicated CSS patterns across\n * Illuminator panel/tab components. Components should compose these alongside\n * their prefixed component-specific classes.\n *\n * Usage:  className=\"ilu-section htab-section\"\n *   The ilu-* class provides the base structural pattern.\n *   The component-prefixed class adds/overrides unique properties.\n *\n * Canonical reference: apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ActivityPanel.css\n * ADR: docs/adr/029-panel-css-utilities.md\n */\n\n/* ── Section card container ──\n * Padded container with bg-secondary, border, radius.\n * Used by: htab-section, pt-checklist, vtab-section, itab-cover-section,\n *          itab-compat-panel, enrtab-container, crv-refinements, crv-panel, etc.\n */\n.ilu-section {\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.ilu-section-title {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.ilu-section-mb {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n/* ── Overflow container ──\n * Container without padding, with overflow hidden. For containers that have\n * a separate header bar and body section.\n * Used by: crv-checks-panel, crp-synth, crp-acv, ref-tab-synth, ref-tab-fcv,\n *          ctab-viewer, ctab-summary-section, ctab-tertiary-section, etc.\n */\n.ilu-container {\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* ── Collapsible header bar ──\n * Header bar inside a container, with bg-tertiary background.\n * Used by: crp-synth-header, crp-acv-header, ref-tab-synth-header,\n *          ref-tab-fcv-header, ctab-viewer-toolbar, ctab-summary-header,\n *          vtab-report-header, etc.\n */\n.ilu-container-header {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.ilu-container-header-bordered {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n/* ── Action button ──\n * Standard action button with bg-tertiary, border, rounded.\n * Used by: cic-action-btn, enrtab-button, htab-annotate-btn, htab-prep-btn,\n *          htab-backport-btn, pt-refrow-btn, vtab-action-btn, vtab-regen-btn,\n *          events-panel-export-btn, events-panel-clear-filters-btn, etc.\n */\n.ilu-action-btn {\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn:not(:disabled) {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn:disabled {\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* Smaller variant */\n.ilu-action-btn-sm {\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  background: var(--bg-tertiary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn-sm:not(:disabled) {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.ilu-action-btn-sm:disabled {\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n/* ── Empty state ──\n * Centered empty state text.\n * Used by: ap-empty-state, cip-empty-state, events-panel-empty,\n *          crv-empty, dmw-empty-state, htab-empty, itab-empty, etc.\n */\n.ilu-empty {\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  padding: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* ── Footer actions row ──\n * Row of actions at the bottom of a dialog or panel.\n * Used by: bcm-footer, dmw-footer, cfr-footer.\n */\n.ilu-footer {\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  gap: 8px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n/* ── Warning banner ──\n * Amber-tinted warning banner.\n * Used by: pp-key-warning, itab-version-warning, crv-stale-warning.\n */\n.ilu-warning-banner {\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  background: rgb(245 158 11 / 10%);\n  border: 1px solid rgb(245 158 11 / 30%);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n/* ── Error banner ──\n * Red-tinted error banner.\n * Used by: cfr-error-banner, dmw-review-error, cip-error-message.\n */\n.ilu-error-banner {\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  background: rgb(239 68 68 / 10%);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid rgb(239 68 68 / 30%);\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n/* ── Status colors ──\n * Inline status color utilities. Used pervasively across all panel CSS.\n */\n.ilu-status-success { color: #10b981; }\n.ilu-status-warning { color: #f59e0b; }\n.ilu-status-error { color: #ef4444; }\n\n/* ── Footer button sizing ──\n * Standard footer button sizing for dialog footers.\n * Used by: bcm-footer-btn, rfm-footer-btn, dmw-footer-btn.\n */\n.ilu-footer-btn {\n  padding: 6px 16px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n/* ── Section heading (uppercase label) ──\n * Small uppercase label for section headings within panels.\n * Used by: bcm-section-label, cfr-context-heading, cfr-field-label, etc.\n */\n.ilu-section-label {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":183,"oldLines":3,"newStart":183,"newLines":75,"lines":["   font-weight: 600;","   letter-spacing: 0.5px;"," }","+","+/* ── Selection bar ──","+ * Sticky bar showing selected-item count with bulk actions.","+ * Used by: eq-selection-bar, eb-selection-bar, rp-selection-bar.","+ */","+.ilu-selection-bar {","+  display: flex;","+  align-items: center;","+  justify-content: space-between;","+  padding: 12px 16px;","+  background: var(--bg-secondary);","+  border: 1px solid var(--accent-color);","+  border-radius: 6px;","+}","+","+/* ── Stats grid ──","+ * Grid of stat cards with large values and muted labels.","+ * Used by: tps-stats-grid, storage-panel-stats-grid, rp-stats-bar.","+ */","+.ilu-stats-grid {","+  display: grid;","+  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(100px, 1fr));","+  gap: 12px;","+  margin-bottom: 16px;","+}","+","+.ilu-stat-card {","+  padding: 10px;","+  background: var(--bg-tertiary);","+  border-radius: 6px;","+  text-align: center;","+}","+","+.ilu-stat-value {","+  font-size: 20px;","+  font-weight: 600;","+}","+","+.ilu-stat-label {","+  font-size: 11px;","+  color: var(--text-muted);","+}","+","+/* ── Thumbnail cover image ──","+ * Absolute-positioned image filling its container with cover fit.","+ * Used by: cip-thumb-img, ipm-thumbnail-img, storage-panel-thumbnail-img.","+ */","+.ilu-thumb-cover {","+  position: absolute;","+  top: 0;","+  left: 0;","+  width: 100%;","+  height: 100%;","+  object-fit: cover;","+}","+","+/* ── Thumbnail placeholder ──","+ * Absolute-positioned centered placeholder for loading/missing thumbnails.","+ * Used by: cip-thumb-loading, ipm-thumbnail-placeholder, storage-panel-thumbnail-placeholder.","+ */","+.ilu-thumb-placeholder {","+  position: absolute;","+  top: 0;","+  left: 0;","+  width: 100%;","+  height: 100%;","+  display: flex;","+  align-items: center;","+  justify-content: center;","+  color: var(--text-muted);","+  font-size: 11px;","+}"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
