{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MKDWB8jPasTGGcxoSXkVpb","type":"tool_result","content":"    40→### Intentional Exceptions\n    41→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/HistorianMarginNotes.css` — entirely unique historian-specific typography and color styles (Georgia serif, sepia tones); no structural patterns to consolidate\n    42→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/EntityCoveragePanel.css` — highly domain-specific table/grid layout with dot/star/ratio indicators; no match to shared panel patterns\n    43→\n    44→### Migration Notes\n    45→Component CSS files currently retain their prefixed class selectors with duplicate properties removed. The next step is for JSX/TSX to compose `ilu-*` utility classes alongside component-prefixed classes (e.g., `className=\"ilu-section htab-section\"`). This is tracked as incremental migration — existing components continue to work as-is since the property removal only affects classes that will gain those properties from the shared utility.\n    46→\n    47→---\n    48→\n    49→## 2026-02-28 — Error Display Pattern Divergence\n    50→\n    51→### Canonical Pattern\n    52→Shared `<ErrorMessage>` component from `@the-canonry/shared-components` with props: `message` (required), `title` (optional), `className` (optional). Reference implementation: `packages/shared-components/src/components/ErrorMessage.jsx`. CSS: `packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/error-message.css`.\n    53→\n    54→### Files Changed\n    55→\n    56→**Illuminator panels/lists (inline error → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n    57→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ActivityPanel.jsx` — replaced `<div className=\"ap-error-detail\">` with `<ErrorMessage>` per task error\n    58→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ProgressPanel.jsx` — replaced `pp-error-item` list items with `<ErrorMessage title={name} message={error}>` per task\n    59→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/TraitPaletteSection.tsx` — replaced `tps-error-item` divs with `<ErrorMessage>` per error\n    60→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/BulkOperationShell.jsx` — replaced `bulk-failed-item` spans with `<ErrorMessage title={label} message={error}>`\n    61→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ChronicleWizard/steps/RoleAssignmentStep.tsx` — replaced `ras-error` divs with `<ErrorMessage>` per validation error\n    62→\n    63→**Full-screen state cards (error text → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n    64→- `apps/viewer/webui/src/StatusScreen.jsx` — replaced title+detail divs with `<ErrorMessage title=\"Bundle unavailable\" message={...}>`; added `@the-canonry/shared-components` dependency\n    65→- `apps/archivist/webui/src/ArchivistRemote.tsx` — replaced title+message divs with `<ErrorMessage title=\"World data unavailable\" message={...}>`\n    66→- `apps/chronicler/webui/src/components/ChroniclerStatusScreen.tsx` — replaced CSS module title+detail with `<ErrorMessage title=\"World Data Unavailable\" message={...}>`\n    67→\n    68→**Toast notifications (error text → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n    69→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ChroniclePanel.jsx` — replaced `Error: ${result.error}` strings with `<ErrorMessage message={...}>` in 3 toast error branches; added CSS override for `.chron-toast .error-message` to inherit toast styling\n    70→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ChroniclePanel.css` — added `.chron-toast .error-message` override rule\n    71→\n    72→**Sync status (error case → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n    73→- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/IlluminatorTabContent.jsx` — split success/error paths; error case now uses `<ErrorMessage>`, success case keeps green status div\n    74→\n    75→**Validation (error header → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n    76→- `apps/lore-weave/webui/src/components/validation/ValidationPanel.jsx` — replaced error card header (path+message divs) with `<ErrorMessage title={path} message={message}>`; kept structured detail body (expected/got/suggestion) as-is\n    77→\n    78→### Shared Utilities Created/Updated\n    79→- `packages/shared-components/src/components/ErrorMessage.jsx` — already existed (created in prior session)\n    80→- `packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/error-message.css` — already existed\n    81→- `apps/viewer/webui/package.json` — added `@the-canonry/shared-components` workspace dependency\n    82→\n    83→### Prior Work (already migrated before this session)\n    84→All Illuminator modal files (ImageModal, DynamicsGenerationModal, HistorianReviewModal, SummaryRevisionModal, ChronicleImagePanel, DescriptionMotifWeaver, CoverImageControls, CorpusFindReplace, ChronologyModal, EraNarrativeModal), ExportView, and Canonry App.jsx were already using `<ErrorMessage>` from shared-components.\n    85→\n    86→All Name Forge files (GenerateTab, EntityWorkspace, LexemesTab, TestPanel, CultureSidebar, GrammarsTab, TestTab) were already using `<ErrorMessage>`.\n    87→\n    88→### Intentional Exceptions\n    89→- None — all files in the drift manifest have been migrated.\n    90→\n    91→### Breaking Changes\n    92→- None. All changes preserve existing behavior. The `<ErrorMessage>` component's `className` prop allows component-specific CSS to coexist with the shared error styling.\n    93→\n    94→### Open Questions\n    95→- Toast error styling: the `.chron-toast .error-message` CSS override makes `<ErrorMessage>` transparent inside toasts. This works but couples the toast layout to knowledge of the shared component's class name. A future toast notification component could encapsulate this.\n    96→- Full-screen state cards still wrap `<ErrorMessage>` in app-specific card layouts. A shared `<StatusScreen>` component could further unify these if desired.\n    97→\n    98→## 2026-02-28 — Prefixed ID generation — produce unique IDs in the format prefix_timestamp_uuid-slice for database records\n    99→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b5b64fd-02b5-4d0c-8463-5e560f74a8b2","uuid":"ed4f2176-b905-4b4a-a0e6-5dab621120a5","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/UNIFICATION_LOG.md","content":"### Intentional Exceptions\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/HistorianMarginNotes.css` — entirely unique historian-specific typography and color styles (Georgia serif, sepia tones); no structural patterns to consolidate\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/EntityCoveragePanel.css` — highly domain-specific table/grid layout with dot/star/ratio indicators; no match to shared panel patterns\n\n### Migration Notes\nComponent CSS files currently retain their prefixed class selectors with duplicate properties removed. The next step is for JSX/TSX to compose `ilu-*` utility classes alongside component-prefixed classes (e.g., `className=\"ilu-section htab-section\"`). This is tracked as incremental migration — existing components continue to work as-is since the property removal only affects classes that will gain those properties from the shared utility.\n\n---\n\n## 2026-02-28 — Error Display Pattern Divergence\n\n### Canonical Pattern\nShared `<ErrorMessage>` component from `@the-canonry/shared-components` with props: `message` (required), `title` (optional), `className` (optional). Reference implementation: `packages/shared-components/src/components/ErrorMessage.jsx`. CSS: `packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/error-message.css`.\n\n### Files Changed\n\n**Illuminator panels/lists (inline error → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ActivityPanel.jsx` — replaced `<div className=\"ap-error-detail\">` with `<ErrorMessage>` per task error\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ProgressPanel.jsx` — replaced `pp-error-item` list items with `<ErrorMessage title={name} message={error}>` per task\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/TraitPaletteSection.tsx` — replaced `tps-error-item` divs with `<ErrorMessage>` per error\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/BulkOperationShell.jsx` — replaced `bulk-failed-item` spans with `<ErrorMessage title={label} message={error}>`\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ChronicleWizard/steps/RoleAssignmentStep.tsx` — replaced `ras-error` divs with `<ErrorMessage>` per validation error\n\n**Full-screen state cards (error text → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n- `apps/viewer/webui/src/StatusScreen.jsx` — replaced title+detail divs with `<ErrorMessage title=\"Bundle unavailable\" message={...}>`; added `@the-canonry/shared-components` dependency\n- `apps/archivist/webui/src/ArchivistRemote.tsx` — replaced title+message divs with `<ErrorMessage title=\"World data unavailable\" message={...}>`\n- `apps/chronicler/webui/src/components/ChroniclerStatusScreen.tsx` — replaced CSS module title+detail with `<ErrorMessage title=\"World Data Unavailable\" message={...}>`\n\n**Toast notifications (error text → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ChroniclePanel.jsx` — replaced `Error: ${result.error}` strings with `<ErrorMessage message={...}>` in 3 toast error branches; added CSS override for `.chron-toast .error-message` to inherit toast styling\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/ChroniclePanel.css` — added `.chron-toast .error-message` override rule\n\n**Sync status (error case → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n- `apps/illuminator/webui/src/components/IlluminatorTabContent.jsx` — split success/error paths; error case now uses `<ErrorMessage>`, success case keeps green status div\n\n**Validation (error header → `<ErrorMessage>`):**\n- `apps/lore-weave/webui/src/components/validation/ValidationPanel.jsx` — replaced error card header (path+message divs) with `<ErrorMessage title={path} message={message}>`; kept structured detail body (expected/got/suggestion) as-is\n\n### Shared Utilities Created/Updated\n- `packages/shared-components/src/components/ErrorMessage.jsx` — already existed (created in prior session)\n- `packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/error-message.css` — already existed\n- `apps/viewer/webui/package.json` — added `@the-canonry/shared-components` workspace dependency\n\n### Prior Work (already migrated before this session)\nAll Illuminator modal files (ImageModal, DynamicsGenerationModal, HistorianReviewModal, SummaryRevisionModal, ChronicleImagePanel, DescriptionMotifWeaver, CoverImageControls, CorpusFindReplace, ChronologyModal, EraNarrativeModal), ExportView, and Canonry App.jsx were already using `<ErrorMessage>` from shared-components.\n\nAll Name Forge files (GenerateTab, EntityWorkspace, LexemesTab, TestPanel, CultureSidebar, GrammarsTab, TestTab) were already using `<ErrorMessage>`.\n\n### Intentional Exceptions\n- None — all files in the drift manifest have been migrated.\n\n### Breaking Changes\n- None. All changes preserve existing behavior. The `<ErrorMessage>` component's `className` prop allows component-specific CSS to coexist with the shared error styling.\n\n### Open Questions\n- Toast error styling: the `.chron-toast .error-message` CSS override makes `<ErrorMessage>` transparent inside toasts. This works but couples the toast layout to knowledge of the shared component's class name. A future toast notification component could encapsulate this.\n- Full-screen state cards still wrap `<ErrorMessage>` in app-specific card layouts. A shared `<StatusScreen>` component could further unify these if desired.\n\n## 2026-02-28 — Prefixed ID generation — produce unique IDs in the format prefix_timestamp_uuid-slice for database records\n","numLines":60,"startLine":40,"totalLines":262}}}
