{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PJtJfyPdMxHFWFQdXBnaoT","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * Editor layout styles - common patterns across all editors\n     3→ */\n     4→\n     5→/* Main editor container */\n     6→.editor-container {\n     7→  padding: var(--spacing-2xl);\n     8→  color: var(--color-text);\n     9→}\n    10→\n    11→/* Editor header */\n    12→.header {\n    13→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);\n    14→}\n    15→\n    16→.title {\n    17→  font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);\n    18→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n    19→  color: var(--color-text);\n    20→  margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md) 0;\n    21→}\n    22→\n    23→.subtitle {\n    24→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n    25→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n    26→  margin: 0;\n    27→}\n    28→\n    29→/* ==========================================================================\n    30→   List layouts\n    31→   ========================================================================== */\n    32→\n    33→/* Multi-column responsive grid for clickable cards */\n    34→.list-grid {\n    35→  display: grid;\n    36→  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr));\n    37→  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n    38→}\n    39→\n    40→/* Single column stack for expandable cards */\n    41→.list-stack {\n    42→  display: flex;\n    43→  flex-direction: column;\n    44→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n    45→}\n    46→\n    47→/* Items grid (vertical stack for nested items) */\n    48→.items-grid {\n    49→  display: flex;\n    50→  flex-direction: column;\n    51→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n    52→}\n    53→\n    54→/* Add container */\n    55→.add-container {\n    56→  margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n    57→}\n    58→\n    59→/* Tab content area */\n    60→.tab-content {\n    61→  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n    62→}\n    63→\n    64→/* Input grid layouts */\n    65→.input-grid {\n    66→  display: grid;\n    67→  grid-tem