{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Akn6GoUSnBkpRb9jXBr4sb","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * Editor layout styles - common patterns across all editors\n     3→ */\n     4→\n     5→/* Main editor container */\n     6→.editor-container {\n     7→  padding: var(--spacing-2xl);\n     8→  color: var(--color-text);\n     9→}\n    10→\n    11→/* Editor header */\n    12→.header {\n    13→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);\n    14→}\n    15→\n    16→.title {\n    17→  font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);\n    18→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n    19→  color: var(--color-text);\n    20→  margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md) 0;\n    21→}\n    22→\n    23→.subtitle {\n    24→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n    25→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n    26→  margin: 0;\n    27→}\n    28→\n    29→/* ==========================================================================\n    30→   List layouts\n    31→   ========================================================================== */\n    32→\n    33→/* Multi-column responsive grid for clickable cards */\n    34→.list-grid {\n    35→  display: grid;\n    36→  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr));\n    37→  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n    38→}\n    39→\n    40→/* Single column stack for expandable cards */\n    41→.list-stack {\n    42→  display: flex;\n    43→  flex-direction: column;\n    44→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n    45→}\n    46→\n    47→\n    48→/* Items grid (vertical stack for nested items) */\n    49→.items-grid {\n    50→  display: flex;\n    51→  flex-direction: column;\n    52→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n    53→}\n    54→\n    55→/* Add container */\n    56→.add-container {\n    57→  margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n    58→}\n    59→\n    60→/* Tab content area */\n    61→.tab-content {\n    62→  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n    63→}\n    64→\n    65→/* Input grid layouts */\n    66→.input-grid {\n    67→  display: grid;\n    68→  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n    69→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n    70→}\n    71→\n    72→/* ==========================================================================\n    73→   Stat displays\n    74→   ========================================================================== */\n    75→\n    76→.stat {\n    77→  display: flex;\n    78→  flex-direction: column;\n    79→  gap: var(--spacing-xs);\n    80→}\n    81→\n    82→.stat-label {\n    83→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n    84→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n    85→  text-transform: uppercase;\n    86→  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    87→}\n    88→\n    89→.stat-value {\n    90→  font-size: var(--font-size-xl);\n    91→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n    92→  color: var(--color-accent);\n    93→}\n    94→\n    95→.stat-bar {\n    96→  width: 60px;\n    97→  height: 4px;\n    98→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n    99→  border-radius: 2px;\n   100→  margin-top: var(--spacing-xs);\n   101→  overflow: hidden;\n   102→}\n   103→\n   104→.stat-bar-fill {\n   105→  height: 100%;\n   106→  border-radius: 2px;\n   107→  transition: width var(--transition-normal);\n   108→}\n   109→\n   110→/* ==========================================================================\n   111→   Expandable card - cards that expand inline to show content\n   112→   ========================================================================== */\n   113→\n   114→.expandable-card {\n   115→  background-color: var(--color-bg-card);\n   116→  border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);\n   117→  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n   118→  overflow: hidden;\n   119→}\n   120→\n   121→.expandable-card-header {\n   122→  display: flex;\n   123→  align-items: center;\n   124→  justify-content: space-between;\n   125→  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n   126→  cursor: pointer;\n   127→  transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);\n   128→}\n   129→\n   130→.expandable-card-header:hover {\n   131→  background-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 10%);\n   132→}\n   133→\n   134→.expandable-card-left {\n   135→  display: flex;\n   136→  align-items: center;\n   137→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n   138→}\n   139→\n   140→.expandable-card-title {\n   141→  display: flex;\n   142→  flex-direction: column;\n   143→  gap: var(--spacing-xs);\n   144→}\n   145→\n   146→.expandable-card-name {\n   147→  font-size: var(--font-size-xl);\n   148→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n   149→  color: var(--color-text);\n   150→}\n   151→\n   152→.expandable-card-id {\n   153→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   154→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   155→  font-family: monospace;\n   156→}\n   157→\n   158→.expandable-card-desc {\n   159→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   160→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   161→  margin-top: var(--spacing-md);\n   162→}\n   163→\n   164→.expandable-card-stats {\n   165→  display: flex;\n   166→  gap: var(--spacing-2xl);\n   167→}\n   168→\n   169→.expandable-card-actions {\n   170→  display: flex;\n   171→  align-items: center;\n   172→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   173→}\n   174→\n   175→.expandable-card-content {\n   176→  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n   177→  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n   178→}\n   179→\n   180→.expand-icon {\n   181→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n   182→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   183→  transition: transform var(--transition-normal);\n   184→}\n   185→\n   186→.expand-icon-expanded {\n   187→  transform: rotate(90deg);\n   188→}\n   189→\n   190→.expand-icon-collapsed {\n   191→  transform: rotate(0deg);\n   192→}\n   193→\n   194→/* ==========================================================================\n   195→   Nested card - small inline cards for nested items (factors, etc)\n   196→   ========================================================================== */\n   197→\n   198→.nested-card {\n   199→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   200→  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n   201→  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n   202→  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n   203→  display: flex;\n   204→  align-items: center;\n   205→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n   206→  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n   207→}\n   208→\n   209→.nested-card:hover {\n   210→  border-color: var(--color-accent);\n   211→}\n   212→\n   213→.nested-card-header {\n   214→  display: flex;\n   215→  align-items: center;\n   216→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   217→  flex: 1;\n   218→}\n   219→\n   220→.nested-card-icon {\n   221→  font-size: var(--font-size-xl);\n   222→}\n   223→\n   224→.nested-card-info {\n   225→  display: flex;\n   226→  flex-direction: column;\n   227→  gap: var(--spacing-xs);\n   228→  flex: 1;\n   229→}\n   230→\n   231→.nested-card-type {\n   232→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   233→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   234→  color: var(--color-text);\n   235→}\n   236→\n   237→.nested-card-summary {\n   238→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   239→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   240→}\n   241→\n   242→.nested-card-coefficient {\n   243→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n   244→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n   245→  white-space: nowrap;\n   246→}\n   247→\n   248→.nested-card-actions {\n   249→  display: flex;\n   250→  align-items: center;\n   251→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n   252→}\n   253→\n   254→.nested-card-list {\n   255→  display: flex;\n   256→  flex-direction: column;\n   257→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   258→}\n   259→\n   260→.nested-card-empty {\n   261→  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n   262→  text-align: center;\n   263→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   264→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   265→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   266→  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n   267→  border: 1px dashed var(--color-border-light);\n   268→}\n   269→\n   270→/* ==========================================================================\n   271→   Condition card - for filters, rules, conditions\n   272→   ========================================================================== */\n   273→\n   274→.condition-card {\n   275→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   276→  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n   277→  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n   278→  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n   279→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n   280→  transition: border-color var(--transition-fast);\n   281→}\n   282→\n   283→.condition-card:hover {\n   284→  border-color: var(--color-border);\n   285→}\n   286→\n   287→.condition-card-header {\n   288→  display: flex;\n   289→  align-items: center;\n   290→  justify-content: space-between;\n   291→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n   292→}\n   293→\n   294→.condition-card-type {\n   295→  display: flex;\n   296→  align-items: center;\n   297→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   298→}\n   299→\n   300→.condition-card-icon {\n   301→  width: 32px;\n   302→  height: 32px;\n   303→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n   304→  display: flex;\n   305→  align-items: center;\n   306→  justify-content: center;\n   307→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n   308→  flex-shrink: 0;\n   309→}\n   310→\n   311→.condition-card-label {\n   312→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   313→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   314→  color: var(--color-text);\n   315→}\n   316→\n   317→.condition-card-summary {\n   318→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   319→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   320→  margin-top: 2px;\n   321→}\n   322→\n   323→.condition-card-fields {\n   324→  display: flex;\n   325→  flex-wrap: wrap;\n   326→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n   327→}\n   328→\n   329→.condition-card-actions {\n   330→  display: flex;\n   331→  align-items: center;\n   332→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n   333→}\n   334→\n   335→.condition-card-nested {\n   336→  margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n   337→  padding-left: var(--spacing-xl);\n   338→  border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border-light);\n   339→}\n   340→\n   341→.condition-list {\n   342→  display: flex;\n   343→  flex-direction: column;\n   344→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   345→}\n   346→\n   347→/* Inline add button for conditions */\n   348→.btn-add-inline {\n   349→  display: inline-flex;\n   350→  align-items: center;\n   351→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n   352→  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);\n   353→  background-color: transparent;\n   354→  border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);\n   355→  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n   356→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   357→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   358→  cursor: pointer;\n   359→  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n   360→}\n   361→\n   362→.btn-add-inline:hover {\n   363→  border-color: var(--color-accent);\n   364→  color: var(--color-accent);\n   365→}\n   366→\n   367→/* Filter fields layout - still used within condition cards */\n   368→.filter-fields {\n   369→  display: flex;\n   370→  flex-wrap: wrap;\n   371→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n   372→}\n   373→\n   374→/* ==========================================================================\n   375→   Icon buttons for cards\n   376→   ========================================================================== */\n   377→\n   378→.icon-button {\n   379→  background: none;\n   380→  border: none;\n   381→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   382→  cursor: pointer;\n   383→  padding: var(--spacing-sm);\n   384→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n   385→  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n   386→}\n   387→\n   388→.icon-button:hover {\n   389→  color: var(--color-text);\n   390→  background-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 10%);\n   391→}\n   392→\n   393→.delete-button:hover {\n   394→  color: var(--color-danger);\n   395→  background-color: rgb(239 68 68 / 10%);\n   396→}\n   397→\n   398→/* ==========================================================================\n   399→   Compact empty state\n   400→   ========================================================================== */\n   401→\n   402→.empty-state-compact {\n   403→  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n   404→  text-align: center;\n   405→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   406→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   407→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   408→  border: 1px dashed var(--color-border-light);\n   409→  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n   410→}\n   411→\n   412→/* ==========================================================================\n   413→   Summary stats grid\n   414→   ========================================================================== */\n   415→\n   416→.summary-stats-grid {\n   417→  display: grid;\n   418→  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(100px, 1fr));\n   419→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n   420→}\n   421→\n   422→.summary-stat {\n   423→  display: flex;\n   424→  flex-direction: column;\n   425→  align-items: center;\n   426→  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n   427→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   428→  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n   429→  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n   430→  text-align: center;\n   431→}\n   432→\n   433→.summary-stat-icon {\n   434→  font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);\n   435→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n   436→}\n   437→\n   438→.summary-stat-value {\n   439→  font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);\n   440→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n   441→  color: var(--color-accent);\n   442→}\n   443→\n   444→.summary-stat-label {\n   445→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   446→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   447→  margin-top: var(--spacing-xs);\n   448→  text-transform: uppercase;\n   449→  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n   450→}\n   451→\n   452→/* ==========================================================================\n   453→   Danger zone\n   454→   ========================================================================== */\n   455→\n   456→.danger-zone {\n   457→  margin-top: var(--spacing-2xl);\n   458→  padding-top: var(--spacing-xl);\n   459→  border-top: 1px solid rgb(239 68 68 / 30%);\n   460→  display: flex;\n   461→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n   462→}\n   463→\n   464→/* ==========================================================================\n   465→   Path constraint card (compact inline constraint editor)\n   466→   ========================================================================== */\n   467→\n   468→.path-constraint-card {\n   469→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   470→  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n   471→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n   472→  padding: var(--spacing-md);\n   473→  display: flex;\n   474→  flex-direction: column;\n   475→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n   476→}\n   477→\n   478→.path-constraint-header {\n   479→  display: flex;\n   480→  align-items: center;\n   481→  justify-content: space-between;\n   482→}\n   483→\n   484→.path-constraint-label {\n   485→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   486→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   487→  color: var(--color-accent);\n   488→}\n   489→\n   490→.constraint-fields-grid {\n   491→  display: grid;\n   492→  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(120px, 1fr));\n   493→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   494→}\n   495→\n   496→/* ==========================================================================\n   497→   App header bar\n   498→   ========================================================================== */\n   499→\n   500→.app-header {\n   501→  display: flex;\n   502→  justify-content: space-between;\n   503→  align-items: center;\n   504→  padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-xl);\n   505→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   506→  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n   507→  flex-shrink: 0;\n   508→}\n   509→\n   510→.app-header-left {\n   511→  display: flex;\n   512→  align-items: center;\n   513→  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n   514→}\n   515→\n   516→.app-header-right {\n   517→  display: flex;\n   518→  align-items: center;\n   519→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   520→}\n   521→\n   522→.app-logo {\n   523→  font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);\n   524→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);\n   525→  color: var(--color-accent);\n   526→  letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n   527→  cursor: pointer;\n   528→  transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);\n   529→}\n   530→\n   531→.app-logo:hover {\n   532→  opacity: 0.8;\n   533→}\n   534→\n   535→/* ==========================================================================\n   536→   Project selector dropdown\n   537→   ========================================================================== */\n   538→\n   539→.project-selector {\n   540→  position: relative;\n   541→}\n   542→\n   543→.project-selector-trigger {\n   544→  display: flex;\n   545→  align-items: center;\n   546→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n   547→  padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-lg);\n   548→  background-color: var(--color-bg-card);\n   549→  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n   550→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n   551→  color: var(--color-text);\n   552→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n   553→  cursor: pointer;\n   554→  min-width: 200px;\n   555→  justify-content: space-between;\n   556→}\n   557→\n   558→.project-selector-trigger:hover {\n   559→  border-color: var(--color-accent);\n   560→}\n   561→\n   562→.project-selector-name {\n   563→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   564→  overflow: hidden;\n   565→  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n   566→  white-space: nowrap;\n   567→}\n   568→\n   569→.project-selector-chevron {\n   570→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   571→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   572→}\n   573→\n   574→.project-dropdown {\n   575→  position: absolute;\n   576→  top: 100%;\n   577→  left: 0;\n   578→  margin-top: var(--spacing-xs);\n   579→  background-color: var(--color-bg-card);\n   580→  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n   581→  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);\n   582→  min-width: 320px;\n   583→  max-height: 400px;\n   584→  overflow-y: auto;\n   585→  z-index: var(--z-dropdown);\n   586→  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n   587→}\n   588→\n   589→.project-dropdown-header {\n   590→  display: flex;\n   591→  justify-content: space-between;\n   592→  align-items: center;\n   593→  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n   594→  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n   595→}\n   596→\n   597→.project-dropdown-title {\n   598→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   599→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n   600→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   601→  text-transform: uppercase;\n   602→  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n   603→}\n   604→\n   605→.project-dropdown-actions {\n   606→  display: flex;\n   607→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n   608→}\n   609→\n   610→.project-list {\n   611→  padding: var(--spacing-md);\n   612→}\n   613→\n   614→.project-item {\n   615→  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n   616→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n   617→  cursor: pointer;\n   618→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);\n   619→  background-color: transparent;\n   620→  transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);\n   621→}\n   622→\n   623→.project-item:hover {\n   624→  background-color: var(--color-bg);\n   625→}\n   626→\n   627→.project-item-active {\n   628→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   629→}\n   630→\n   631→.project-item-name {\n   632→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n   633→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   634→  color: var(--color-text);\n   635→  margin-bottom: 2px;\n   636→}\n   637→\n   638→.project-item-meta {\n   639→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   640→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   641→  display: flex;\n   642→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n   643→}\n   644→\n   645→.project-item-actions {\n   646→  display: flex;\n   647→  gap: var(--spacing-xs);\n   648→  margin-top: var(--spacing-md);\n   649→}\n   650→\n   651→/* ==========================================================================\n   652→   Small/micro buttons\n   653→   ========================================================================== */\n   654→\n   655→.btn-sm {\n   656→  padding: var(--spacing-xs) var(--spacing-md);\n   657→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   658→  border: none;\n   659→  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n   660→  cursor: pointer;\n   661→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   662→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   663→  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n   664→}\n   665→\n   666→.btn-sm:hover {\n   667→  background-color: var(--color-bg);\n   668→  color: var(--color-text);\n   669→}\n   670→\n   671→.btn-sm-primary {\n   672→  background: var(--gradient-accent);\n   673→  color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   674→}\n   675→\n   676→.btn-sm-primary:hover {\n   677→  filter: brightness(1.1);\n   678→}\n   679→\n   680→.btn-sm-danger {\n   681→  color: var(--color-danger);\n   682→}\n   683→\n   684→.btn-sm-danger:hover {\n   685→  background-color: rgb(239 68 68 / 15%);\n   686→}\n   687→\n   688→.btn-xs {\n   689→  padding: 2px var(--spacing-md);\n   690→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   691→  border: none;\n   692→  border-radius: 2px;\n   693→  cursor: pointer;\n   694→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   695→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   696→}\n   697→\n   698→.btn-xs:hover {\n   699→  color: var(--color-text);\n   700→}\n   701→\n   702→/* ==========================================================================\n   703→   Help modal styles\n   704→   ========================================================================== */\n   705→\n   706→.help-modal {\n   707→  max-width: 700px;\n   708→  max-height: 85vh;\n   709→  height: auto;\n   710→}\n   711→\n   712→.help-section {\n   713→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);\n   714→}\n   715→\n   716→.help-section:last-child {\n   717→  margin-bottom: 0;\n   718→}\n   719→\n   720→.help-section-title {\n   721→  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n   722→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n   723→  color: var(--color-text);\n   724→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n   725→}\n   726→\n   727→.help-text {\n   728→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   729→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   730→  line-height: 1.7;\n   731→  margin: 0;\n   732→}\n   733→\n   734→.workflow-step {\n   735→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);\n   736→  padding-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);\n   737→  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n   738→}\n   739→\n   740→.workflow-step:last-child {\n   741→  margin-bottom: 0;\n   742→  padding-bottom: 0;\n   743→  border-bottom: none;\n   744→}\n   745→\n   746→.workflow-step-header {\n   747→  display: flex;\n   748→  align-items: center;\n   749→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   750→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n   751→}\n   752→\n   753→.workflow-step-number {\n   754→  width: 24px;\n   755→  height: 24px;\n   756→  border-radius: 50%;\n   757→  display: flex;\n   758→  align-items: center;\n   759→  justify-content: center;\n   760→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   761→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);\n   762→  color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   763→  flex-shrink: 0;\n   764→}\n   765→\n   766→.workflow-step-title {\n   767→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   768→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n   769→  color: var(--color-text);\n   770→}\n   771→\n   772→.workflow-step-desc {\n   773→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   774→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   775→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n   776→  margin-left: 32px;\n   777→}\n   778→\n   779→.workflow-step-list {\n   780→  margin: 0;\n   781→  padding-left: 48px;\n   782→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   783→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   784→  line-height: 1.8;\n   785→}\n   786→\n   787→/* ==========================================================================\n   788→   Simple modal (non-tabbed, compact)\n   789→   ========================================================================== */\n   790→\n   791→.modal-simple {\n   792→  max-width: 400px;\n   793→  height: auto;\n   794→  max-height: none;\n   795→}\n   796→\n   797→.modal-simple .modal-body {\n   798→  flex-direction: column;\n   799→  padding: var(--spacing-2xl);\n   800→}\n   801→\n   802→.modal-actions {\n   803→  display: flex;\n   804→  justify-content: flex-end;\n   805→  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n   806→  margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);\n   807→}\n   808→\n   809→.modal-status {\n   810→  display: flex;\n   811→  align-items: center;\n   812→  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n   813→}\n   814→\n   815→.modal-spinner {\n   816→  width: 32px;\n   817→  height: 32px;\n   818→  border-radius: 999px;\n   819→  border: 3px solid var(--color-border);\n   820→  border-top-color: var(--color-accent);\n   821→  animation: modal-spinner-spin 0.9s linear infinite;\n   822→  flex-shrink: 0;\n   823→}\n   824→\n   825→.modal-status-title {\n   826→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   827→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n   828→  color: var(--color-text);\n   829→}\n   830→\n   831→.modal-status-subtitle {\n   832→  margin-top: var(--spacing-xs);\n   833→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n   834→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   835→}\n   836→\n   837→@keyframes modal-spinner-spin {\n   838→  to {\n   839→    transform: rotate(360deg);\n   840→  }\n   841→}\n   842→\n   843→/* ==========================================================================\n   844→   Slot selector dropdown (for run slots)\n   845→   ========================================================================== */\n   846→\n   847→.slot-selector {\n   848→  position: relative;\n   849→}\n   850→\n   851→.slot-selector-trigger {\n   852→  display: flex;\n   853→  align-items: center;\n   854→  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n   855→  padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-lg);\n   856→  background-color: var(--color-bg-card);\n   857→  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n   858→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n   859→  color: var(--color-text);\n   860→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   861→  cursor: pointer;\n   862→  min-width: 160px;\n   863→  justify-content: space-between;\n   864→}\n   865→\n   866→.slot-selector-trigger:hover {\n   867→  border-color: var(--color-accent);\n   868→}\n   869→\n   870→.slot-selector-name {\n   871→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   872→  overflow: hidden;\n   873→  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n   874→  white-space: nowrap;\n   875→}\n   876→\n   877→.slot-selector-chevron {\n   878→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   879→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   880→}\n   881→\n   882→.slot-dropdown {\n   883→  position: absolute;\n   884→  top: 100%;\n   885→  left: 0;\n   886→  margin-top: var(--spacing-xs);\n   887→  background-color: var(--color-bg-card);\n   888→  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n   889→  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);\n   890→  min-width: 280px;\n   891→  max-height: 350px;\n   892→  overflow-y: auto;\n   893→  z-index: var(--z-dropdown);\n   894→  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);\n   895→}\n   896→\n   897→.slot-dropdown-header {\n   898→  display: flex;\n   899→  justify-content: space-between;\n   900→  align-items: center;\n   901→  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);\n   902→  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n   903→}\n   904→\n   905→.slot-dropdown-title {\n   906→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   907→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n   908→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   909→  text-transform: uppercase;\n   910→  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n   911→}\n   912→\n   913→.slot-list {\n   914→  padding: var(--spacing-sm);\n   915→}\n   916→\n   917→.slot-item {\n   918→  display: flex;\n   919→  align-items: center;\n   920→  justify-content: space-between;\n   921→  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);\n   922→  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n   923→  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);\n   924→  background-color: transparent;\n   925→  transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);\n   926→}\n   927→\n   928→.slot-item:last-child {\n   929→  margin-bottom: 0;\n   930→}\n   931→\n   932→.slot-item:hover {\n   933→  background-color: var(--color-bg);\n   934→}\n   935→\n   936→.slot-item-active {\n   937→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   938→}\n   939→\n   940→.slot-item-empty {\n   941→  opacity: 0.7;\n   942→}\n   943→\n   944→.slot-item-content {\n   945→  flex: 1;\n   946→  min-width: 0;\n   947→}\n   948→\n   949→.slot-item-name {\n   950→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   951→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   952→  color: var(--color-text);\n   953→  overflow: hidden;\n   954→  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n   955→  white-space: nowrap;\n   956→}\n   957→\n   958→.slot-item-empty .slot-item-name {\n   959→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n   960→  font-style: italic;\n   961→}\n   962→\n   963→.slot-active-indicator {\n   964→  color: var(--color-accent);\n   965→  margin-right: var(--spacing-xs);\n   966→}\n   967→\n   968→.slot-item-meta {\n   969→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   970→  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n   971→  margin-top: 2px;\n   972→}\n   973→\n   974→.slot-item-actions {\n   975→  display: flex;\n   976→  align-items: center;\n   977→  gap: var(--spacing-xs);\n   978→  margin-left: var(--spacing-md);\n   979→}\n   980→\n   981→.slot-status {\n   982→  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n   983→  color: var(--color-accent);\n   984→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   985→}\n   986→\n   987→.slot-title-input {\n   988→  width: 100%;\n   989→  padding: var(--spacing-xs) var(--spacing-sm);\n   990→  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n   991→  border: 1px solid var(--color-accent);\n   992→  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n   993→  color: var(--color-text);\n   994→  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n   995→  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n   996→  outline: none;\n   997→}\n   998→\n   999→.slot-empty-hint {\n  1000→  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  1001→  text-align: center;\n  1002→  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n  1003→  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n  1004→}\n  1005→\n  1006→.btn-xs-primary {\n  1007→  background: var(--gradient-accent);\n  1008→  color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n  1009→}\n  1010→\n  1011→.btn-xs-primary:hover {\n  1012→  filter: brightness(1.1);\n  1013→}\n  1014→\n  1015→.btn-xs-danger {\n  1016→  background: transparent;\n  1017→  color: var(--color-danger);\n  1018→  border-color: var(--color-danger);\n  1019→  padding: 2px 6px;\n  1020→  font-size: 14px;\n  1021→  line-height: 1;\n  1022→}\n  1023→\n  1024→.btn-xs-danger:hover {\n  1025→  background: rgb(239 68 68 / 20%);\n  1026→}\n  1027→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f674cf0-9f5a-4696-8008-0664523e53e2","uuid":"873dbdbd-2aca-44b8-afae-34548e4fd6fc","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/styles/components/editor.css","content":"/**\n * Editor layout styles - common patterns across all editors\n */\n\n/* Main editor container */\n.editor-container {\n  padding: var(--spacing-2xl);\n  color: var(--color-text);\n}\n\n/* Editor header */\n.header {\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);\n}\n\n.title {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n  color: var(--color-text);\n  margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md) 0;\n}\n\n.subtitle {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   List layouts\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* Multi-column responsive grid for clickable cards */\n.list-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr));\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n}\n\n/* Single column stack for expandable cards */\n.list-stack {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n\n/* Items grid (vertical stack for nested items) */\n.items-grid {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n/* Add container */\n.add-container {\n  margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n/* Tab content area */\n.tab-content {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n}\n\n/* Input grid layouts */\n.input-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Stat displays\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.stat {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xs);\n}\n\n.stat-label {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-xs);\n  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n}\n\n.stat-value {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-xl);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n  color: var(--color-accent);\n}\n\n.stat-bar {\n  width: 60px;\n  height: 4px;\n  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  margin-top: var(--spacing-xs);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.stat-bar-fill {\n  height: 100%;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  transition: width var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Expandable card - cards that expand inline to show content\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.expandable-card {\n  background-color: var(--color-bg-card);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.expandable-card-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.expandable-card-header:hover {\n  background-color: rgb(59 130 246 / 10%);\n}\n\n.expandable-card-left {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.expandable-card-title {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xs);\n}\n\n.expandable-card-name {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-xl);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n  color: var(--color-text);\n}\n\n.expandable-card-id {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n  font-family: monospace;\n}\n\n.expandable-card-desc {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  margin-top: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.expandable-card-stats {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-2xl);\n}\n\n.expandable-card-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.expandable-card-content {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n}\n\n.expand-icon {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  transition: transform var(--transition-normal);\n}\n\n.expand-icon-expanded {\n  transform: rotate(90deg);\n}\n\n.expand-icon-collapsed {\n  transform: rotate(0deg);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Nested card - small inline cards for nested items (factors, etc)\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.nested-card {\n  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.nested-card:hover {\n  border-color: var(--color-accent);\n}\n\n.nested-card-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.nested-card-icon {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-xl);\n}\n\n.nested-card-info {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xs);\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.nested-card-type {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n  color: var(--color-text);\n}\n\n.nested-card-summary {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n}\n\n.nested-card-coefficient {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.nested-card-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.nested-card-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.nested-card-empty {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl);\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  border: 1px dashed var(--color-border-light);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Condition card - for filters, rules, conditions\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.condition-card {\n  background-color: var(--color-bg-dark);\n  border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  transition: border-color var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.condition-card:hover {\n  border-color: var(--color-border);\n}\n\n.condition-card-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.condition-card-type {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.condition-card-icon {\n  width: 32px;\n  height: 32px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: var(--font-size-lg);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.condition-card-label {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n  font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);\n  color: var(--color-text);\n}\n\n.condition-card-summary {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-sm);\n  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.condition-card-fields {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.condition-card-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.condition-card-nested {\n  margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\n  padding-left: var(--spacing-xl);\n  border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border-light);\n}\n\n.condition-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n/* Inline add button for conditions */\n.btn-add-inline {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: var(--spacing-sm);\n  padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);\n  background-color: transparent;\n  border: 1px dashed var(--color-border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n  font-size: var(--font-size-md);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.btn-add-inline:hover {\n  border-color: var(--color-accent);\n  color: var(--color-accent);\n}\n\n/* Filter fields layout - still used within condition cards */\n.filter-fields {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Icon buttons for cards\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.icon-button {\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  color: var(--color-text-dim);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: var(--spacing-sm);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  transition: all var(--transition-fast);\n}\n\n.icon-button:hover {\n  color: var(--color-text);\n  background-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 10%);\n}\n\n.delete-button:hover {\n  color: var(--color-danger);\n  background-color: rgb(239 68 68 / 10%);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   Compact empty state\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n.empty-state-compact {\n  padd