{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Ewvei8Lj8WYK8fHZ1XHVxQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me understand the pattern. Let me look at what CSS classes are actually used in each component so I understand what needs to stay component-local vs what can be shared.\n\nThe three CSS files share these duplicated patterns:\n\n1. **Action buttons** (tertiary style): `background: var(--bg-tertiary)`, `border: 1px solid var(--border-color)`, `border-radius: 6px`, `color: var(--text-secondary)`, `cursor: pointer` — appears in:\n   - `hec-make-active-btn`, `hec-export-btn` (HistorianEditionComparison.css)\n   - `cvs-btn-make-active`, `cvs-btn-delete` (ChronicleVersionSelector.css)\n   - `wsh-btn-unpublish`, `wsh-btn-regenerate`, `wsh-btn-overflow` (WorkspaceHeader.css)\n\n2. **Active badge** (green pill): `font-size: 11px`, `padding: 2px 8px`, `background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15)`, `color: #10b981`, `border-radius: 999px`, `font-weight: 500` — appears across multiple components.\n\n3. **Compact select inputs** with `width: auto`, `font-size: 12px`, `padding: 4px 6px` are used in HistorianEditionComparison and ChronicleVersionSelector.\n\n4. **Disabled button state** applies `cursor: not-allowed` and `opacity: 0.6` to inactive buttons across these components.\n\nNow I'm noticing the disabled state inconsistency — the shared button.css uses `opacity: 0.5` while these components use `0.6`. I also see there's no compact tertiary button variant in the shared styles, and the existing secondary button padding is too large for what these components need. The better approach is to add shared utility classes for these duplicated patterns and update the component files to reference them, keeping component-specific overrides local. I need to consolidate these duplicated styles by creating shared variants for the compact button, active badge, and compact select, then update each component to reference them instead of maintaining their own CSS rules.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6036,"cache_read_input_tokens":57280,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6036},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"012353ca-34db-4cb3-82b9-4cf23efde1ac","uuid":"67b7170e-88a2-405a-a757-e0cb53692f34"}
