{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CJfym579vq1eLp2Gubr6ev","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full picture. The shared-components package already has:\n1. `theme.css` — centralized design tokens with its own `:root` custom properties\n2. `base.css` — CSS reset and base styles\n3. `index.css` — entry point that imports everything\n\nBut the two App.css files each redefine their OWN `:root` variables with different naming conventions:\n- App.css uses `--bg-primary`, `--bg-secondary`, `--border-color`, `--text-color`, `--space-xs`, `--text-xs`, etc.\n- theme.css uses `--color-bg`, `--color-bg-card`, `--color-border`, `--color-text`, `--spacing-xs`, `--font-size-xs`, etc.\n\n\nThe core problem is that the App.css files have created a completely separate token naming system that doesn't align with the shared theme, so I can't just swap them out without updating all the references throughout the codebase.\n\nLooking at the actual overlap though, the two App.css files are nearly identical except for their accent colors and app-specific component classes. The real opportunity is extracting that massive shared foundation—the backgrounds, borders, text colors, spacing, typography, semantic colors, and resets—into a unified base that both apps can inherit from, then only keep the accent color differences separate.\n\nThe tricky part is that shared-components already has a theme.css with different variable names, so I either need to refactor both apps to use those names or create a new arctic-base file that preserves the current naming convention. Option two feels more practical given the scope, but I should double-check what lore-weave's App.css actually contains first.\n\nWait, the work item only covers illuminator and name-forge, not lore-weave. Let me dig into both files more thoroughly to figure out what's genuinely shared versus what's app-specific.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2328,"cache_read_input_tokens":56721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2328},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f96e591f-9951-4599-91ca-4e5e08bd5234","uuid":"38e642c3-adc4-4890-b44c-c8ee56ae7acb"}
