{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0196g4VWkyKxifxnqWMXu4Ef","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary: css-css-cluster-014 — App.css Arctic Theme Base Consolidation\n\n### Part 1: Unification\n\n**Problem:** `apps/illuminator/webui/src/App.css` and `apps/name-forge/webui/src/App.css` both defined ~82 identical lines of `:root` custom properties (backgrounds, borders, text, arctic palette, spacing, fonts, component colors, semantic colors), CSS reset, and body styles. The only differences were accent colors (purple vs gold) and app-specific component classes.\n\n**Solution:** Extracted the shared base into a single canonical file.\n\n**Files created/changed:**\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `packages/shared-components/src/styles/arctic-theme-base.css` | **New** — shared `:root` vars, reset, body |\n| `packages/shared-components/package.json` | Added `\"./styles/arctic-theme-base\"` export |\n| `apps/illuminator/webui/src/App.css` | Replaced 82 duplicated lines with `@import` + purple accent overrides |\n| `apps/name-forge/webui/src/App.css` | Replaced 82 duplicated lines with `@import` + gold accent overrides |\n| `UNIFICATION_LOG.md` | Appended entry |\n\n**Intentional exception:** `apps/lore-weave/webui/src/App.css` uses `--lw-` prefixed names — a different naming convention, not part of this cluster.\n\n### Part 2: Guard\n\n| Artifact | Path |\n|----------|------|\n| ESLint rule | `eslint-rules/no-app-css-base-duplication.js` — detects App.css files that redefine shared base vars without importing the shared base |\n| ADR | `docs/adr/036-app-css-base-consolidation.md` |\n| Pattern doc | `docs/patterns/app-css-theme.md` |\n| Config wiring | `eslint.config.js` — `local/no-app-css-base-duplication: \"warn\"` |\n\n**Guard verification:** 0 violations (correct — unification is complete). Rule will fire if someone removes the `@import` and re-adds shared base vars manually."}],"stop_reason