{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016pb2SYcDwsvFzmR7rv7BLh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the pattern. I need to:\n\n1. Create an ESLint rule that bans defining `display: block`, `pointer-events: none`, and cursor utility classes directly in visualization CSS files (since those should come from `visualization-base.css`). However, ESLint rules operate on JS/JSX/TS/TSX files, not CSS files. So I need to think about what I can actually enforce.\n\nThe enforceable constraint is: **In visualization TSX/JSX files, ban the old component-prefixed class names** that were just replaced. This prevents someone from re-creating `ec-no-pointer`, `tb-no-pointer`, `ec-cursor-pointer`, `tb-grab`, `tb-ew-resize` as class names in JSX — they should use the shared `viz-*` classes instead.\n\n\nI'll write a custom ESLint rule that targets visualization files and scans JSX className attributes for the old component-prefixed utility patterns like `ec-no-pointer`, `tb-grab`, and `nt-cursor-pointer`, flagging them to use the new `viz-*` equivalents instead.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3755,"cache_read_input_tokens":70904,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3755},"output_tokens":12,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ee4ea11c-d389-40b8-aae4-dcc42ada4575","uuid":"a19434e1-ac91-4d4f-8779-b4329c0951a4"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016pb2SYcDwsvFzmR7rv7BLh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create the ESLint guard rule. The enforceable constraint is: in visualization component TSX/JSX files, ban component-prefixed utility class names (like `ec-no-pointer`, `tb-grab`) that should use the shared `viz-*` utilities instead."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3755,"cache_read_input_tokens":70904,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3755},"output_tokens":12,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ee4ea11c-d389-40b8-aae4-dcc42ada4575","uuid":"2a8f0250-9ebe-400b-8c49-396bb32bbc6f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016pb2SYcDwsvFzmR7rv7BLh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01F4RzrJG6a5ppXdFoSUUGPo","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/eslint-rules/no-viz-utility-drift.js","content":"// drift-generated\n/**\n * Bans component-prefixed SVG visualization utility class names in the\n * ChronicleWizard/visualizations directory. These utilities (display:block,\n * pointer-events:none, cursor variants) live in visualization-base.css\n * and should be referenced with the shared viz-* prefix.\n *\n * See docs/patterns/visualization-base-css.md\n */\nexport default {\n  meta: {\n    type: \"suggestion\",\n    docs: {\n      description:\n        \"Enforce shared viz-* utility classes instead of per-component duplicates in visualization CSS\",\n    },\n    messages: {\n      useSharedClass:\n        'Use \"{{shared}}\" from visualization-base.css instead of component-prefixed \"{{found}}\". See docs/patterns/visualization-base-css.md',\n    },\n    schema: [],\n  },\n\n  create(context) {\n    const filename = context.filename || context.getFilename();\n\n    // Only enforce in the visualizations directory\n    if (!filename.includes(\"ChronicleWizard/visualizations\") &&\n        !filename.includes(\"ChronicleWizard\\\\visualizations\")) {\n      return {};\n    }\n\n    // Utility suffixes that belong in visualization-base.css\n    // Maps suffix → shared class name\n    const UTILITY_SUFFIXES = {\n      \"no-pointer\": \"viz-no-pointer\",\n      \"cursor-pointer\": \"viz-cursor-pointer\",\n      \"grab\": \"viz-grab\",\n      \"ew-resize\": \"viz-ew-resize\",\n    };\n\n    // Pattern: any 2-3 letter prefix followed by a dash and a known utility suffix\n    // e.g. ec-no-pointer, tb-grab, nt-cursor-pointer\n    const DRIFT_PATTERN = /\\b([a-z]{2,4})-(no-pointer|cursor-pointer|grab|ew-resize)\\b/g;\n\n    function checkClassString(node, value) {\n      let match;\n      DRIFT_PATTERN.lastIndex = 0;\n      while ((match = DRIFT_PATTERN.exec(value)) !== null) {\n        const fullMatch = match[0];\n        const suffix = match[2];\n        const shared = UTILITY_SUFFIXES[suffix];\n\n        // Don't flag the shared viz-* classes themselves\n        if (fullMatch.startsWith(\"viz-\")) continue;\n\n        context.report({\n          node,\n          messageId: \"useSharedClass\",\n          data: { shared, found: fullMatch },\n        });\n      }\n    }\n\n    return {\n      JSXAttribute(node) {\n        if (node.name.name !== \"className\") return;\n\n        // className=\"literal string\"\n        if (node.value && node.value.type === \"Literal\" && typeof node.value.value === \"string\") {\n          checkClassString(node, node.value.value);\n        }\n\n        // className={`template ${literal}`}\n        if (\n          node.value &&\n          node.value.type === \"JSXExpressionContainer\" &&\n          node.value.expression.type === \"TemplateLiteral\"\n        ) {\n          for (const quasi of node.value.expression.quasis) {\n            checkClassString(node, quasi.value.raw);\n          }\n        }\n      },\n    };\n  },\n};\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3755,"cache_read_input_tokens":70904,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3755},"output_tokens":12,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ee4ea11c-d389-40b8-aae4-dcc42ada4575","uuid":"e765f4a4-2d72-426d-87f1-a6517f27c774"}
