{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BNofJVodazcfC7zsY2c2SQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All deliverables are complete. Here's a summary:\n\n## Part 1: Unify\n\n**Shared CSS created:** `apps/cosmographer/webui/src/styles/cosmographer-editor.css`\n- 24 shared `cosmo-*` classes covering modals, forms, buttons, layout, and empty states\n\n**AxisRegistry refactored:**\n- `AxisRegistry.css` — removed 19 duplicated rules, now imports shared CSS and keeps only component-specific rules (axis cards, range display, tags, usage info, input row, save opacity)\n- `index.jsx` — all shared elements updated to use `cosmo-*` class names\n\n**RelationshipEditor refactored:**\n- `RelationshipEditor.css` — removed 16 duplicated rules, now imports shared CSS and keeps only component-specific rules (filter select, table layout, kind badge, entity link, modal width, empty state background)\n- `index.jsx` — all shared elements updated to use `cosmo-*` class names\n\n**UNIFICATION_LOG.md** — appended entry documenting all changes and noting CultureEditor/EntityEditor as follow-up candidates.\n\n## Part 2: Guard\n\n**ESLint rule:** `eslint-rules/no-cosmo-editor-drift.js`\n- Bans 38 old per-component class names (`axr-modal`, `axr-form-group`, `re-modal`, `re-form-group`, etc.) in cosmographer files\n- Wired into `eslint.config.js` at `warn` severity\n\n**ADR:** `docs/adr/040-cosmographer-editor-css.md`\n- Documents the decision, shared class namespace, and references the ESLint rule\n\n**Pattern doc:** `docs/patterns/cosmographer-editor-css.md`\n- Practical usage guide with copy-paste examples showing how to use the shared classes in new editors"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":331,"cache_read_input_tokens":100796,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":331},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"