{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Convert these shared-components files from JavaScript with PropTypes to TypeScript with interfaces. For each file:\n1. Read the current file\n2. Remove `import PropTypes from 'prop-types'`\n3. Add a TypeScript interface for props based on the PropTypes definition\n4. Remove the `.propTypes = { ... }` block at the end\n5. Keep ALL existing logic, JSDoc comments, and behavior\n6. Write the converted file back using Edit tool\n\nFiles to convert (all in /home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/):\n- components/SectionHeader.tsx\n- components/AddCard.tsx\n- components/AddItemButton.tsx\n- components/CategorySection.tsx\n- components/ItemRow.tsx\n- components/ExpandableCard.tsx\n- components/NumberInput.tsx\n- components/LocalTextArea.tsx\n\nIMPORTANT: Use the Edit tool, not Write. Remove PropTypes import AND the .propTypes block. Keep `import React`. For `ReactNode`, use `React.ReactNode`. TypeScript interfaces go above the component function.\n\nConversion rules:\n- `PropTypes.string.isRequired` → `propName: string` (required)\n- `PropTypes.string` → `propName?: string` (optional)\n- `PropTypes.bool` → `propName?: boolean`\n- `PropTypes.func` → `propName?: () => void` or more specific if JSDoc indicates\n- `PropTypes.func.isRequired` → `propName: (...args: unknown[]) => void` or more specific\n- `PropTypes.node` → `propName?: React.ReactNode`\n- `PropTypes.number` → `propName?: number`\n- `PropTypes.array` / `PropTypes.arrayOf(...)` → `propName?: SomeType[]`\n- `PropTypes.object` / `PropTypes.shape({...})` → inline interface or `Record<string, unknown>`\n- `PropTypes.oneOf([...])` → union type\n- `PropTypes.any` → `propName?: unknown`\n\nFor callback functions, look at the JSDoc and component usage to infer parameter types. Use `(value: string) => void` style for onChange handlers, `() => void` for simple callbacks.\nKeep `export default` statements if they exist."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DXHnyHJoT74nhx47Xbmsts","session_id":"e54c7e2e-0d44-4856-a582-afde6e85abbc","uuid":"afa01e44-01db-4c5a-9810-40dfe3dc3f8f"}
