{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VgBFvRXMRQ4puD2ocQgrhi","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * ReferenceDropdown - A styled dropdown for entity/reference selection\n     3→ *\n     4→ * Supports two modes:\n     5→ * - Simple mode (default): Standard <select> dropdown\n     6→ * - Searchable mode: Popover with search filtering for large lists\n     7→ */\n     8→\n     9→import React, { useState, useMemo, useRef, useEffect, useId } from 'react';\n    10→import PropTypes from 'prop-types';\n    11→\n    12→/**\n    13→ * @param {Object} props\n    14→ * @param {string} props.value - Current selected value\n    15→ * @param {Function} props.onChange - Callback when selection changes\n    16→ * @param {Array<{value: string, label?: string, meta?: string}>} props.options - Array of options\n    17→ * @param {string} [props.placeholder] - Placeholder text for empty selection\n    18→ * @param {string} [props.label] - Optional label above the dropdown\n    19→ * @param {boolean} [props.searchable] - Enable searchable popover mode (default: false)\n    20→ * @param {string} [props.className] - Additional class names\n    21→ */\n    22→export function ReferenceDropdown({\n    23→  value,\n    24→  onChange,\n    25→  options,\n    26→  placeholder,\n    27→  label,\n    28→  searchable = false,\n    29→  className = '',\n    30→}) {\n    31→  const generatedId = useId();\n    32→  // Searchable mode state\n    33→  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\n    34→  const [search, setSearch] = useState('');\n    35→  const containerRef = useRef(null);\n    36→\n    37→  // Close on outside click (searchable mode)\n    38→  useEffect(() => {\n    39→    if (!searchable) return;\n    40→\n    41→    const handleClickOutside = (e) => {\n    42→      if (containerRef.current && !containerRef.current.contains(e.target)) {\n    43→        setIsOpen(false);\n    44→      }\n    45→    };\n    46→    document.addEventListener('mousedown', handleClickOutside);\n    47→    return () => document.removeEventListener('mousedown', handleClickOutside);\n    48→  }, [searchable]);\n    49→\n    50→  // Filter options in searchable mode\n    51→  const filteredOptions = useMemo(() => {\n    52→    if (!searchable || !search) return options;\n    53→    const lower = search.toLowerCase();\n    54→    return options.filter(\n    55→      (opt) =>\n    56→        opt.value.toLowerCase().includes(lower) ||\n    57→        opt.label?.toLowerCase().includes(lower)\n    58→    );\n    59→  }, [options, search, searchable]);\n    60→\n    61→  const selectedOption = options.find((opt) => opt.value === value);\n    62→\n    63→  // Simple mode: render a standard <select>\n    64→  if (!searchable) {\n    65→    return (\n    66→      <div className={`form-group ${className}`.trim()}>\n    67→        {label && <label htmlFor={generatedId} className=\"label\">{label}</label>}\n    68→        <select id={generatedId}\n    69→          className=\"select\"\n    70→          value={value || ''}\n    71→          onChange={(e) => onChange(e.target.value || undefined)}\n    72→        >\n    73→          <option value=\"\">{placeholder || 'Select...'}</option>\n    74→          {options.map((opt) => (\n    75→            <option key={opt.value} value={opt.value}>\n    76→              {opt.label || opt.value}\n    77→            </option>\n    78→          ))}\n    79→        </select>\n    80→      </div>\n    81→    );\n    82→  }\n    83→\n    84→  // Searchable mode: render popover with search\n    85→  return (\n    86→    <div className={`form-group ${className}`.trim()}>\n    87→      {label && <label className=\"label\">{label}</label>}\n    88→      <div ref={containerRef} className=\"dropdown\">\n    89→        <div\n    90→          className=\"dropdown-trigger\"\n    91→          onClick={() => setIsOpen(!isOpen)}\n    92→          role=\"button\"\n    93→          tabIndex={0}\n    94→          onKeyDown={(e) => { if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") e.currentTarget.click(); }}\n    95→        >\n    96→          <span className={selectedOption ? '' : 'dropdown-trigger-placeholder'}>\n    97→            {selectedOption?.label ||\n    98→              selectedOption?.value ||\n    99→              placeholder ||\n   100→              'Select...'}\n   101→          </span>\n   102→          <span className=\"dropdown-arrow\">▼</span>\n   103→        </div>\n   104→        {isOpen && (\n   105→          <div className=\"dropdown-menu\">\n   106→            <div className=\"dropdown-search\">\n   107→              <input\n   108→                type=\"text\"\n   109→                className=\"dropdown-search-input\"\n   110→                placeholder=\"Search...\"\n   111→                value={search}\n   112→                onChange={(e) => setSearch(e.target.value)}\n   113→                onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\n   114→                // eslint-disable-next-line jsx-a11y/no-autofocus\n   115→                autoFocus\n   116→              />\n   117→            </div>\n   118→            <div className=\"dropdown-options\">\n   119→              {filteredOptions.length === 0 ? (\n   120→                <div className=\"dropdown-empty\">No options found</div>\n   121→              ) : (\n   122→                filteredOptions.map((opt) => (\n   123→                  <div\n   124→                    key={opt.value}\n   125→                    className={`dropdown-option ${value === opt.value ? 'dropdown-option-selected' : ''}`}\n   126→                    onClick={() => {\n   127→                      onChange(opt.value);\n   128→                      setIsOpen(false);\n   129→                      setSearch('');\n   130→                    }}\n   131→                    role=\"button\"\n   132→                    tabIndex={0}\n   133→                    onKeyDown={(e) => { if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") e.currentTarget.click(); }}\n   134→                  >\n   135→                    <span>{opt.label || opt.value}</span>\n   136→                    {opt.meta && (\n   137→                      <span className=\"dropdown-option-meta\">{opt.meta}</span>\n   138→                    )}\n   139→                  </div>\n   140→                ))\n   141→              )}\n   142→            </div>\n   143→          </div>\n   144→        )}\n   145→      </div>\n   146→    </div>\n   147→  );\n   148→}\n   149→\n   150→export default ReferenceDropdown;\n   151→\n   152→ReferenceDropdown.propTypes = {\n   153→  value: PropTypes.string,\n   154→  onChange: PropTypes.func.isRequired,\n   155→  options: PropTypes.array.isRequired,\n   156→  placeholder: PropTypes.string,\n   157→  label: PropTypes.string,\n   158→  searchable: PropTypes.bool,\n   159→  className: PropTypes.string,\n   160→};\n   161→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FzRVY2V2nJRXov651T5ucP","session_id":"e54c7e2e-0d44-4856-a582-afde6e85abbc","uuid":"07629192-2c2e-472f-911d-0d75681427c8"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0134QmcHMCZgGJkCrYc7BCeb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Hg7LzrrmVQCanmkxy96CPT","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/components/ChipSelect.tsx"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4749,"cache_read_input_tokens":26545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4749},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FzRVY2V2nJRXov651T5ucP","session_id":"e54c7e2e-0d44-4856-a582-afde6e85abbc","uuid":"d5bd12c1-8853-49b0-9309-2621104cc4ee"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hg7LzrrmVQCanmkxy96CPT","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * ChipSelect - Multi-select component with searchable dropdown\n     3→ *\n     4→ * Displays selected items as removable chips with a searchable dropdown to add more.\n     5→ */\n     6→\n     7→import React, { useState, useMemo, useRef, useEffect } from 'react';\n     8→import PropTypes from 'prop-types';\n     9→\n    10→/**\n    11→ * @param {Object} props\n    12→ * @param {string[]} props.value - Array of selected values\n    13→ * @param {Function} props.onChange - Callback when selection changes\n    14→ * @param {Array<{value: string, label?: string}>} props.options - Available options\n    15→ * @param {string} [props.placeholder] - Placeholder text when empty\n    16→ * @param {string} [props.label] - Optional label above the component\n    17→ */\n    18→export function ChipSelect({\n    19→  value = [],\n    20→  onChange,\n    21→  options,\n    22→  placeholder = 'Add...',\n    23→  label,\n    24→}) {\n    25→  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\n    26→  const [search, setSearch] = useState('');\n    27→  const containerRef = useRef(null);\n    28→  const inputRef = useRef(null);\n    29→\n    30→  useEffect(() => {\n    31→    const handleClickOutside = (e) => {\n    32→      if (containerRef.current && !containerRef.current.contains(e.target)) {\n    33→        setIsOpen(false);\n    34→      }\n    35→    };\n    36→    document.addEventListener('mousedown', handleClickOutside);\n    37→    return () => document.removeEventListener('mousedown', handleClickOutside);\n    38→  }, []);\n    39→\n    40→  const availableOptions = useMemo(() => {\n    41→    return options.filter(opt => !value.includes(opt.value));\n    42→  }, [options, value]);\n    43→\n    44→  const filteredOptions = useMemo(() => {\n    45→    if (!search) return availableOptions;\n    46→    const lower = search.toLowerCase();\n    47→    return availableOptions.filter(opt =>\n    48→      opt.value.toLowerCase().includes(lower) ||\n    49→      opt.label?.toLowerCase().includes(lower)\n    50→    );\n    51→  }, [availableOptions, search]);\n    52→\n    53→  const handleSelect = (optValue) => {\n    54→    onChange([...value, optValue]);\n    55→    setSearch('');\n    56→    inputRef.current?.focus();\n    57→  };\n    58→\n    59→  const handleRemove = (optValue) => {\n    60→    onChange(value.filter(v => v !== optValue));\n    61→  };\n    62→\n    63→  const getLabel = (val) => {\n    64→    const opt = options.find(o => o.value === val);\n    65→    return opt?.label || val;\n    66→  };\n    67→\n    68→  return (\n    69→    <div className=\"form-group\">\n    70→      {label && <label className=\"label\">{label}</label>}\n    71→      <div ref={containerRef} className=\"dropdown\">\n    72→        <div\n    73→          className=\"chip-container chip-container-input\"\n    74→          onClick={() => {\n    75→            setIsOpen(true);\n    76→            inputRef.current?.focus();\n    77→          }}\n    78→          role=\"button\"\n    79→          tabIndex={0}\n    80→          onKeyDown={(e) => { if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") e.currentTarget.click(); }}\n    81→        >\n    82→          {value.map(v => (\n    83→            <span key={v} className=\"chip\">\n    84→              {getLabel(v)}\n    85→              <button\n    86→                type=\"button\"\n    87→                className=\"chip-remove\"\n    88→                onClick={(e) => {\n    89→                  e.stopPropagation();\n    90→                  handleRemove(v);\n    91→                }}\n    92→              >\n    93→                ×\n    94→              </button>\n    95→            </span>\n    96→          ))}\n    97→          <input\n    98→            ref={inputRef}\n    99→            type=\"text\"\n   100→            placeholder={value.length === 0 ? placeholder : ''}\n   101→            value={search}\n   102→            onChange={(e) => setSearch(e.target.value)}\n   103→            onFocus={() => setIsOpen(true)}\n   104→            className=\"chip-input\"\n   105→          />\n   106→        </div>\n   107→        {isOpen && filteredOptions.length > 0 && (\n   108→          <div className=\"dropdown-menu\">\n   109→            {filteredOptions.map((opt) => (\n   110→              <div\n   111→                key={opt.value}\n   112→                onClick={() => handleSelect(opt.value)}\n   113→                className=\"dropdown-item\"\n   114→                role=\"button\"\n   115→                tabIndex={0}\n   116→                onKeyDown={(e) => { if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") e.currentTarget.click(); }}\n   117→              >\n   118→                {opt.label || opt.value}\n   119→              </div>\n   120→            ))}\n   121→          </div>\n   122→        )}\n   123→      </div>\n   124→    </div>\n   125→  );\n   126→}\n   127→\n   128→export default ChipSelect;\n   129→\n   130→ChipSelect.propTypes = {\n   131→  value: PropTypes.array,\n   132→  onChange: PropTypes.func.isRequired,\n   133→  options: PropTypes.array.isRequired,\n   134→  placeholder: PropTypes.string,\n   135→  label: PropTypes.string,\n   136→};\n   137→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FzRVY2V2nJRXov651T5ucP","session_id":"e54c7e2e-0d44-4856-a582-afde6e85abbc","uuid":"20a0ca9c-d224-4eb9-8f7d-c7306165015e"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0134QmcHMCZgGJkCrYc7BCeb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J7EuzjjKKsvawY5PJurZAW","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/components/SearchableDropdown.tsx"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4749,"cache_read_input_tokens":26545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4749},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FzRVY2V2nJRXov651T5ucP","session_id":"e54c7e2e-0d44-4856-a582-afde6e85abbc","uuid":"a33354f9-9b55-4d07-87b2-30bdfaa3097e"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J7EuzjjKKsvawY5PJurZAW","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * SearchableDropdown - Popover dropdown with search filtering\n     3→ *\n     4→ * Used for selecting from a list of items with search capability.\n     5→ * More user-friendly than native select for large lists.\n     6→ */\n     7→\n     8→import React, { useState, useMemo, useRef, useEffect } from 'react';\n     9→import PropTypes from 'prop-types';\n    10→\n    11→/**\n    12→ * @param {Object} props\n    13→ * @param {Array<{id: string, name?: string}>} props.items - Items to select from\n    14→ * @param {Function} props.onSelect - Called with item ID when selected\n    15→ * @param {string} [props.placeholder] - Placeholder text for trigger\n    16→ * @param {string} [props.emptyMessage] - Message when no items available\n    17→ * @param {string} [props.noMatchMessage] - Message when search has no matches\n    18→ * @param {boolean} [props.searchable] - Whether to show search input (default true)\n    19→ * @param {string} [props.className] - Additional class names\n    20→ */\n    21→export function SearchableDropdown({\n    22→  items,\n    23→  onSelect,\n    24→  placeholder = 'Select...',\n    25→  emptyMessage = 'No items available',\n    26→  noMatchMessage = 'No matches found',\n    27→  searchable = true,\n    28→  className = '',\n    29→}) {\n    30→  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\n    31→  const [search, setSearch] = useState('');\n    32→  const containerRef = useRef(null);\n    33→\n    34→  useEffect(() => {\n    35→    const handleClickOutside = (e) => {\n    36→      if (containerRef.current && !containerRef.current.contains(e.target)) {\n    37→        setIsOpen(false);\n    38→      }\n    39→    };\n    40→    document.addEventListener('mousedown', handleClickOutside);\n    41→    return () => document.removeEventListener('mousedown', handleClickOutside);\n    42→  }, []);\n    43→\n    44→  const filteredItems = useMemo(() => {\n    45→    if (!search) return items;\n    46→    const lower = search.toLowerCase();\n    47→    return items.filter(item =>\n    48→      item.id.toLowerCase().includes(lower) ||\n    49→      item.name?.toLowerCase().includes(lower)\n    50→    );\n    51→  }, [items, search]);\n    52→\n    53→  const handleSelect = (item) => {\n    54→    onSelect(item.id);\n    55→    setIsOpen(false);\n    56→    setSearch('');\n    57→  };\n    58→\n    59→  if (items.length === 0) {\n    60→    return (\n    61→      <div className={`dropdown-trigger dropdown-trigger-disabled ${className}`.trim()}>\n    62→        <span>{emptyMessage}</span>\n    63→      </div>\n    64→    );\n    65→  }\n    66→\n    67→  return (\n    68→    <div ref={containerRef} className={`dropdown ${className}`.trim()}>\n    69→      <div className=\"dropdown-trigger\" onClick={() => setIsOpen(!isOpen)} role=\"button\" tabIndex={0} onKeyDown={(e) => { if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") e.currentTarget.click(); }} >\n    70→        <span>{placeholder}</span>\n    71→        <span className=\"dropdown-arrow\">▼</span>\n    72→      </div>\n    73→      {isOpen && (\n    74→        <div className=\"dropdown-menu\">\n    75→          {searchable && (\n    76→            <div className=\"dropdown-search\">\n    77→              <input\n    78→                type=\"text\"\n    79→                className=\"dropdown-search-input\"\n    80→                placeholder=\"Search...\"\n    81→                value={search}\n    82→                onChange={(e) => setSearch(e.target.value)}\n    83→                onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\n    84→                // eslint-disable-next-line jsx-a11y/no-autofocus\n    85→                autoFocus\n    86→              />\n    87→            </div>\n    88→          )}\n    89→          <div className=\"dropdown-options\">\n    90→            {filteredItems.length === 0 ? (\n    91→              <div className=\"dropdown-empty\">{noMatchMessage}</div>\n    92→            ) : (\n    93→              filteredItems.map((item) => (\n    94→                <div\n    95→                  key={item.id}\n    96→                  className=\"dropdown-option\"\n    97→                  onClick={() => handleSelect(item)}\n    98→                  role=\"button\"\n    99→                  tabIndex={0}\n   100→                  onKeyDown={(e) => { if (e.key === \"Enter\" || e.key === \" \") e.currentTarget.click(); }}\n   101→                >\n   102→                  {item.name || item.id}\n   103→                </div>\n   104→              ))\n   105→            )}\n   106→          </div>\n   107→        </div>\n   108→      )}\n   109→    </div>\n   110→  );\n   111→}\n   112→\n   113→SearchableDropdown.propTypes = {\n   114→  items: PropTypes.array.isRequired,\n   115→  onSelect: PropTypes.func.isRequired,\n   116→  placeholder: PropTypes.string,\n   117→  emptyMessage: PropTypes.string,\n   118→  noMatchMessage: PropTypes.string,\n   119→  searchable: PropTypes.bool,\n   120→  className: PropTypes.string,\n   121→};\n   122→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FzRVY2V2nJRXov651T5ucP","session_id":"e54c7e2e-0d44-4856-a582-afde6e85abbc","uuid":"1fa0462f-9ecd-4c0b-87e7-88494ac14353"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0134QmcHMCZgGJkCrYc7BCeb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NAuV3s8uFVPqacykzYsHyC","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/components/LevelSelector.tsx"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4749,"cache_read_input_tokens":26545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4749},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FzRVY2V2nJRXov651T5ucP","session_id":"e54c7e2e-0d44-4856-a582-afde6e85abbc","uuid":"dfab44df-76a8-4bfd-bf23-d7c6c3c5f05b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016jZxSxnKMdGYT2whVv3ruK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Q69ZBuaPsjdWi3vG3vJ4Bs","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Convert shared-components batch 4","prompt":"Convert these shared-components files from JavaScript with PropTypes to TypeScript with interfaces. For each file:\n1. Read the current file\n2. Remove `import PropTypes from 'prop-types'`\n3. Add TypeScript types based on the PropTypes definition\n4. Remove the `.propTypes = { ... }` block at the end\n5. Keep ALL existing logic and behavior\n6. Write the converted file back using Edit tool\n\nFiles to convert (all in /home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/packages/shared-components/src/):\n- TagSelector.tsx (top-level file, in src/ not in components/)\n- components/ChronicleSeedViewer.tsx\n- components/CoverageMatrix/CoverageMatrix.tsx\n- components/badges/DetailUsageBadges.tsx\n- components/badges/ToolUsageBadges.tsx\n\nIMPORTANT: Use the Edit tool, not Write. Remove PropTypes import AND the .propTypes block. Keep `import React`. For `ReactNode`, use `React.ReactNode`. TypeScript interfaces go above the component function.\n\nFor files with multiple exported components, create a separate interface for each component's props.\n\nConversion rules:\n- `PropTypes.string.isRequired` → `propName: string` (required)\n- `PropTypes.string` → `propName?: string` (optional)\n- `PropTypes.bool` → `propName?: boolean`\n- `PropTypes.func` → optional function type\n- `PropTypes.func.isRequired` → required function type\n- `PropTypes.node` → `React.ReactNode`\n- `PropTypes.number` → `number`\n- `PropTypes.arrayOf(...)` → typed array\n- `PropTypes.shape({...})` → inline type\n- `PropTypes.oneOf([...])` → union type\n- `PropTypes.any` → `unknown`\n- `PropTypes.object` → `Record<string, unknown>`\n\nKeep all `export` and `export default` statements.","subagent_type":"general-purpose"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"sto