{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FE1562c7Y9ru17TmaYzQXA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012c2KGLXcyo6imx9xax9A55","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Convert illuminator hooks batch 1","prompt":"Convert these illuminator JavaScript hook files to TypeScript. The illuminator app already has tsconfig with allowJs: true so these files just need proper TypeScript annotations.\n\nFor each file:\n1. Read the current .js file\n2. Rename it from .js to .ts using Bash: `mv [old] [new]`\n3. Add TypeScript type annotations to the converted .ts file using Edit tool:\n   - Parameter types for the hook function\n   - Return type annotation\n   - Type annotations for state variables (useState generics)\n   - Type annotations for callback parameters\n   - Import types where needed (use `import type` for type-only imports)\n4. Keep ALL existing logic and behavior unchanged\n\nFiles to convert (all in /home/tsonu/src/the-canonry/apps/illuminator/webui/src/hooks/):\n- useApiKeys.js → useApiKeys.ts\n- useConfigSync.js → useConfigSync.ts\n- useBackportFlow.js → useBackportFlow.ts\n- useHistorianCallbacks.js → useHistorianCallbacks.ts\n- useEntityGuidanceSync.js → useEntityGuidanceSync.ts\n- useHistorianConfigSync.js → useHistorianConfigSync.ts\n- useWorldContextSync.js → useWorldContextSync.ts\n\nIMPORTANT: \n- Use `mv` (not `git mv`) since these might be tracked or untracked\n- After renaming, read the new .ts file to add type annotations via Edit\n- For complex callback parameters where types aren't obvious, use `unknown` or generic types rather than `any`\n- Look at neighboring .ts hooks in the same directory for type import patterns\n- Keep existing JSDoc comments","subagent_type":"general-purpose"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":429,"cache_read_input_tokens":100277,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":429},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e54c7e2e-0d44-4856-a582-afde6e85abbc","uuid":"e5ecdcd5-29f4-41b9-ad2e-ca166ec05917"}
