{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017xQ2iBwnam1wWRwAhtAh1V","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→/**\n     2→ * useIlluminatorConfigStore — Zustand store for project-level configuration.\n     3→ *\n     4→ * Centralizes configuration that was previously only available in IlluminatorRemote's\n     5→ * local state. IlluminatorRemote writes to this store via useEffect (one-way sync:\n     6→ * parent writes, children read). Child components and hooks read imperatively via\n     7→ * `useIlluminatorConfigStore.getState()`.\n     8→ *\n     9→ * ## What lives here\n    10→ *\n    11→ * - projectId, simulationRunId: identity (simulationRunId also on entityStore)\n    12→ * - worldContext: canon facts, world dynamics\n    13→ * - historianConfig: historian persona definition\n    14→ * - entityGuidance: entity description/image prompt guidance\n    15→ * - cultureIdentities: culture-specific identity configs\n    16→ *\n    17→ * ## Why a separate store from entityStore\n    18→ *\n    19→ * entityStore holds entity data (nav items, cache). This store holds *configuration*\n    20→ * that drives LLM prompt building and historian operations. Different concerns,\n    21→ * different update cadences.\n    22→ */\n    23→\n    24→import { create } from \"zustand\";\n    25→import { DEFAULT_HISTORIAN_CONFIG } from \"../historianTypes\";\n    26→import type { HistorianConfig } from \"../historianTypes\";\n    27→\n    28→export interface WorldContext {\n    29→  canonFactsWithMetadata?: Array<{ text: string; [key: string]: unknown }>;\n    30→  worldDynamics?: Array<{ text: string; [key: string]: unknown }>;\n    31→  [key: string]: unknown;\n    32→}\n    33→\n    34→interface IlluminatorConfigState {\n    35→  projectId: string | null;\n    36→  simulationRunId: string | null;\n    37→  worldContext: WorldContext;\n    38→  historianConfig: HistorianConfig;\n    39→  entityGuidance: unknown;\n    40→  cultureIdentities: unknown;\n    41→\n    42→  // Historian activity flags — synced from primitive hooks in IlluminatorRemote\n    43→  isHistorianEditionActive: boolean;\n    44→  isHistorianActive: boolean;\n    45→\n    46→  /** Called by IlluminatorRemote to sync config into the store */\n    47→  setConfig: (\n    48→    config: Partial<\n    49→      Pick<\n    50→        IlluminatorConfigState,\n    51→        | \"projectId\"\n    52→        | \"simulationRunId\"\n    53→        | \"worldContext\"\n    54→        | \"historianConfig\"\n    55→        | \"entityGuidance\"\n    56→        | \"cultureIdentities\"\n    57→        | \"isHistorianEditionActive\"\n    58→        | \"isHistorianActive\"\n    59→      >\n    60→    >"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Wo8tpDCEa6S6saPSgXZFWc","session_id":"e54c7e2e-0d44-4856-a582-afde6e85abbc","uuid":"30a98be2-a756-4dbe-9d8c-ce6b0d94f747"}
